Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 倒霉 达茜 你真是不应该来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. Darcy, you really shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那可未必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
