Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所有工作都不能停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No stopping operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 你也要过安检 不可以带相机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You got to go through. No cameras.
