Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的身份首先是地质学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are geologists first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只要这个东西一旦具有重大的历史意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this thing has any historical significance at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就得停止运作 我要亲自让它停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are shutting down. I'm shutting us down.
