Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,天气预报说海边不适合冲浪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, surf report no good at South Padre?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,浪头不够高 车子又没油了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The waves are flat and I got no gas.
