Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我是卢卡斯·法兰纳瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Lucas Flannery.
