Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我爷爷他一辈子都扒在这儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granddaddy ran it all his life. Ain't that right, Granddaddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 这很快就会转到我的名下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real soon he's going to sign it over to me.
