Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们自己来吧 我们看着办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mister, we'll have a look around if you want to leave us to it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,以前呢 大家都会千里迢迢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, folks used to come from miles around
