Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小心头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪你选不上校队呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you didn't make the varsity team.
