Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那球了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迫击炮弹壳 你都经历些什么呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortar shells? What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, snakeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这卡车多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much for the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们再扛两个星期 所有的课就全都上完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two more weeks, girls, till no more classes, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候一定要晒成古铜色再喝个烂醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost time to get a tan and get wasted!
