Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打电话报警了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am dialing 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,随你的便 我无所谓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go right ahead. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打电话报警了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still calling 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,芝加哥之战从此改变了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Battle of Chicago was an event that permanently changed our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡人数超过1300人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over 1,300 dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大片市区惨遭摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much of the city has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,国土安全部号召所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Homeland Security is urging everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,举报可疑的外星人活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to report suspicious alien activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,国会迅速反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A swift act of Congress,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,中止了美军与汽车人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put an end to all joint operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所有联合作战行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between the military and the Autobots,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这个联盟关系就此终止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ending the alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,各位委员都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As this committee knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,五年前入侵芝加哥事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Invasion of Chicago was a defining day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们国家命运的转折点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For our nation five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,数百万人在那天意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day millions of people realized that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能再允许外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never again can we allow aliens,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们卷入宇宙战争了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To fight our battles for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在联合作战行动废除之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A handful of Autobots were given sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那几个汽车人获得了安置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after joint-combat operations were abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只剰下十来个霸天虎还在四处逃窜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fewer than a dozen Decepticons are still on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这多亏我们中情局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to our CIA unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,墓风小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cemetery Wind."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,至于外星人的科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for the alien technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的目标是让美国将其彻底掌控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our objective remains to keep it in American control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.75,0:09:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫提摩西 这是我的小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. My name is Timothy. This is my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在芝加哥发现了外星的旋转炮塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found this alien ball turret in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这部是在瓦砾堆发现的 而且竟然还能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just found it in the rubble and it's all working...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有传言说日本 印度和以色列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word has it Japan, India, the Israelis,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可能持有若干艘机器人飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May have gotten their hands on a couple of ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,俄罗斯正开高价收购\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently the Russians are starting a bidding war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只要五千美元我们就卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking $5,000 for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这有三十六支枪 全部都是外星装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got 36 guns, alien shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,新时代已经开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new era has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而変形金刚时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the age of the Transformers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我等你好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking hot today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 要不你把上衣脱了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? How about you take your shirt off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我现在脱掉上衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to take my shirt off right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,万一被你爸看到怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would your dad think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 太夸张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot believe him. I cannot believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,往前开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 你该不会把钱都砸在这卡车上了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, please tell me you didn't spend our money on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 他花的是我的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, don't worry, he didn't. He spent my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一共一百五十美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred and fifty bucks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那就当是你工资的预付款吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As an advance on your regular paycheck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么时候有工资了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What regular paycheck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.61,0:10:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,工资会发给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which you will get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么时候 - 没戏了 我们破产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When? - Never. We're broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,果不其然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能别挑拨老板和雇员的关系好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you please not drive a wedge between employer and employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩不是是合伙人关系吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. I thought we were partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我手头紧 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I came up short, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给她买毕业舞会的礼服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to buy her a prom dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不让我买吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to deny her a prom dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不买也行 反正你不让她约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might as well. You denied her a prom date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会 我只是要陪她去跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I offered to take her and chaperone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想和自己老爸跳舞啊 搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody wants to go to the dance with their dad. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本就不是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,或许这就是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能不能别拿我说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, could you guys Just get Off my case?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这引擎值多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the engine on this runs for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把它拆了卖掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can break it down and strip it for parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我总觉得你的裤子越来越缩水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sweetheart, your shorts are shrinking by the second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,应该先冷水洗再烘干 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cold water, air dry, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她身材真火辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she looks hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我个单纯的小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a hot teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 单纯小姑娘 这说法还算恰当 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's the "teenager" thing that makes it better. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't sound like what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿个接线板来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That goes by the circuit boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,东西就放那边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the Zeiss lenses over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 拜托 别再花钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, please. You can't keep spending money on junk,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把一堆废品变成另一堆废品了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just so you can turn it into different junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这些怎么能说是废品呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not use the "J" word in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这古董放映机可是稀有的很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a Super Simplex theater projector. It's very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有"微笑领肮员" 怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the SmilePilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这"除草运动机"都是划时代的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the Exer-Mower that I invented? Simply ahead of their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟那只没用的机器看门狗一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like the alleged Guard-Dawg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你看你惹它生气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get him upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 凯德 凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cade! Cade!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿还能用吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing still work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能 - 当然能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是领先的科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and still groundbreaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以找一把躺椅坐下来等它送冰睥酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back there and lay on the recliner and just wait for a cold one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别再搞破坏了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, stop breaking stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,催缴单和滞纳通知单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final notice, late notice, past due.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,过来过来 给老爸把酒拿来 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Bring Daddy the alcohol. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀你这都是从哪收的破烂儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what is all this crap people send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那是CD随身听和老式磁带 听音乐用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a Discman and that's an 8-track tape. Music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,修好这个可以卖一百块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I fix that, it's 100 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那个卖二百五十块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fix that, it's $250.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个如果没被你摔坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I would have been able to fix that before you broke it even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以卖二十块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been 20 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这些钱再加上奖学金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stuff is what's gonna put you through college,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,完全能供你上大学了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you land one of those scholarships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像它这样伺候一趟平均要花多长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the estimated time of arrival, usually? Average?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 它只会把酒拿到你附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. So it just brings the beer near you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这就算完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一两个小瑕疵别在意 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's got a couple kinks, man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 有些东西根本就不该被发明出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you think maybe some things should never be invented?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你错了 这是落伍的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't. That's backwards thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.03,0:12:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是科技的殿堂 一个神圣的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a temple of technology. You guys are standing in a holy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎么样啊 看看这地方多宽敞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think? Why don't you look at all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是你的 这景色多棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be yours. What about this land?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个母夜叉又来了 兴致还挺高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purple People Eater's back and she looks hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这房子很棒是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 说你呢 这房子是我的 我不卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Hey. you! I own this house! It's not for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格先生 你已经六个月没还房贷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months late on payments, Mr. Yeager.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还从电线杆子上偷电用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see you stealing power at the pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那也不关你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that's not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你想参观一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, do you wanna see the property?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意先带你们去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be more than happy to give you a tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,其他买家的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you three other buyers I got buried out back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再用这根球棍打爆你们的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll crack your head open like an egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 退后 他疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! Whoa! - Stay back! He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,前几日告诉过不要再来了 可你又来干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you don't come back here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再敢过来我就要报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have my brother come back and beat your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你等着有你好瞧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you start with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让我哥来收拾你 他可不是吃素的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll bring the police when I come, too! My brother ain't no joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谁 杰瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who, Jerry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧他那个肥样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring his big ass up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上个车会把车都给挤翻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna be huffing and puffing before he can squeeze out of that car!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You back out on my grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你再胆敢把车开进来你就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让杰瑞那小子来找我呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell Jerry to come see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的他满地找牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give him some pecan pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她竟敢撞坏我的离芭墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She smashed through the fence?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 放松点 你都快气的心梗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, relax. You're going to have an aortic infarction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,意思就是心脑血管病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a brain heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那我已经病过一会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've had one already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在还偷电用啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're stealing power now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.62,0:13:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里 只是跟邻居们借一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're borrowing it from the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 真有你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等我毕业离开家以后 谁来照顾你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I graduate and I'm gone, who's gonna take care of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你照顾我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you take care of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那又是谁教你焊接的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who taught you how to solder a circuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁教你编程 梳小辫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or write a program? Or French braid your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,玩橄榄球的都是我 我照顾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or throw a spiral? Me. That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,某人做菜只会用番茄酱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who taught you how to cook without ketchup,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而且根本不会理财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or balance your checkbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是谁在扮演大人的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who always has to be the grownup around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你有理 行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you got a point, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但这也说明我们配合默契\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that means we're a great team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道最近家里状况不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know it's been sucky around here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're gonna be fine, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要有信心 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gotta keep believing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大发明家都是这样 我保证有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that's what great inventors do. I promise you, one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会弄出大发明来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna build something that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈会以你为荣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, your mom would be very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,散开 向右推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread out! Push right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll, roll, roll, roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给我两个人 给我两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me two. Give me two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,上沙滩 慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the beach, nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.89,0:15:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 保持现有位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,启动迷你肮拍机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release the mini-drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,航拍机已升空 航拍机已升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mini-drones was on, The mini-drones was on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机 老鹰已接近 准备开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vipers. Eagle in sight. Cleared hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,探测到热源了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a heat sig.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,最靠近船首的第二根烟囱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second stack. Closest to the bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,掠食者-01 瞄准目标区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Predator 0-1. Captured target area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,准备弹药 全员进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,报告长官 我是枪手01\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leader, leader, this is Gunfighter 0-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老鹰正在进入内部第二层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagles moving internal. Second deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,老鹰正在进入内部第二层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagles moving internal. Second deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,到左舷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the port
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,蛙人83 蛙人83\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frogman 83, Frogman 83.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,向左方推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the left push
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,已进入最上层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breached site on rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉其他部门待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have Echo Platoon on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉直升机我们要出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the helo know we're moving external!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got! I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A小队负责左眩 B小队负责右舷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha, take port. Bravo, take starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,往右 往右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shift right. Shift right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快快 快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,将烟囱炸开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cracking steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit him!...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,立即开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹发射 危险目标靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missiles out. Danger close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:16:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃 快上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's running! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他要逃走 他要逃走 跟着目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the run! He's on the run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别开火啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold! Hold fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没看到我受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you not see? I've been injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Box him in. Box him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是医务官救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical Officer Ratchet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你们的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.45,0:17:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an Autobot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么要逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到预警信息 是擎天柱发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus sent this distress message.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all Autobots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被列为攻击目标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are under targeted attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,停止与人类的任何联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease all contact with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都躲了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所有汽车人都在被追杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Autobots are being hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们深处危险之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,芝加哥之战 我失去了妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost a sister in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,体想我同情你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get no sympathy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们人类出了什么毛病啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 求求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,停火 别开枪 都别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check fire, check fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我来了结他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,禁闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人和霸天虎就像小屁孩一祥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, Decepticons. Like little children,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没完没了的打闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,闹的整个宇宙都不得安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making a mess out of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.89,0:19:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,最后还得由我来收拾烂摊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I've got to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要想活命就必须告诉我 他藏在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one way you survive. Tell me where he's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱到底在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Optimus Prime?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,休想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我现在就成全你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我得说中情局自你接手行动工作以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must say, it is remarkable, really astounding,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,表现得相当出彩 令人眼前一亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The success that the CIA has had since you have taken operational control,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而且是这样 总统要我来问问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so the President has asked me to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,另外也问问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ask him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是否愿意接受邀请来白宫坐一坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To invite you both over to the White House just to powwow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是介绍情况 更多的讲讲细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we get maybe some more specifics
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们说一说你们是如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About how exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,追杀霸天虎残余旧部的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hunting the enemy Decepticons left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:19:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我当局长才两年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had my desk for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾汀杰先生已经干了二十五年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Attinger has been here for 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他负责的案子 我从来不过问具体细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He runs the projects where I don't ask for specifics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是"暗地里"的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they're called Black Ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,正因为如此我们晩上才睡的安稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why we all sleep better at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了 好极了 那么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check. That is great. So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么爆料吗 你们进展的怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any dirt on that? Uh, how, uh, that's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,成果斐然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我想要的 总统会很欣慰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping to hear that. The President will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,因为 虽然我是这个星期一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause, I'll tell you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,才当上幕僚长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only been Chief of Staff since Monday, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我很清楚 只有谈到外星人大战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know that the alien war stuff, these are...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这种会面才会有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the only fun meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的职责并非取悦总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not here to entertain the President,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但你可以告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you may tell him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,战争就要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That the war will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要是万一他问起这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"...be over..." In case he asks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我会转达你的原话 战争就快结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just like to have an exact quote. "War will be over soon."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这个太棒了 多好的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is great. Such good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 还有 嗯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President would,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,以为对他的了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, just love...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会非常乐意 非常非常乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, really love to press the flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,和汽车人领袖握个手之类的或者是拍张合影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not flesh, obviously, but just maybe get a shot with, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么称呼他 擎天柱勋爵还是爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it Lord Prime? Sir Prime?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要不就在空军一号上面会面吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could bop on Air Force One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大家拥抱一下合个影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be just a quick bop, then we just bop in and bop back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是不可能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't get his hopes up on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 他就叫擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's called Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是外星武装人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien combatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,而且是非法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是盟友吗 这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But aren't they our friends? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们只要还在地球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because our world will never truly be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就不会太平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till all of them are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 那要不这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Well, I would hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我还可以办一个类似道别仪式之类的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could do a much more ceremonial farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好歹我们的军队还和他们并肩战斗过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially since our military has worked so closely with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,地球不是他们的 从来都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not their planet. Never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,该夺回主导权了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time we take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 就是这祥 不 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there you go. No, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你别抖啊 你抖什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop shaking! Why are you shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我又不会解雇你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了吃晩餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot to eat dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我为什么担心你了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see why I worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起宝贝 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sorry, sweetie, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点就成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost got it working right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,跟您说个事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经做完功课 期末考也考完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done with homework and set with finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和朋友开车出去玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I was just gonna take a little drive with some friends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if that was okay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不许带男生 这个我知道 等毕了业再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No boys, I know. Graduate first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可别人家都没有这种规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know no one else has this rule, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,别说的这么难听好吗 这叫智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make it sound harsh, okay. It's wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.87,0:22:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大晩上了 就别开车出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we need to be driving around in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,七点四十五 天都快黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already like quarter to eight. It's almost dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.79,0:22:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴德 你消停一会好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spud, will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我毕业的时候在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where I was for my graduation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,知道 我的出生就是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. With me, the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是个惊喜 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The surprise, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是我人生中最美的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the best thing that ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看起来不开心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we look unhappy? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我人生中最棒的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's the greatest day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈去世之前我答应过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made your mother a promise before she passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宝贝女儿不能错过毕业典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our baby's gonna be at her graduation. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,男生高中的时候都是懵懵懂懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High school boys know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,之后才能成熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only later they turn into men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你当初要是成熟就不会有我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you were older and wiser, I wouldn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在咱们俩都不谈恋爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this is a non-dating household, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不谈我也不谈 这样可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't date, I don't date. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.57,0:23:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,或许你该恋爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我管的太多了 但不这样不行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I've been on you, okay? But I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,十二岁到十七岁的青春期是公认的风险期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve to seventeen is the official teenage danger window.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的职责就是帮你顺利的度过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my job to get you through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.82,0:23:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你生气我也得管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can be pissed off all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好 那...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, yes, you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你就跟朋友出去玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a ride with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.05,0:23:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,干活别熬夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't work all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,记得吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.05,0:24:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她是最美的礼物 艾米莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best thing that ever happened, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有了她是我人生中最棒的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the best thing that ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.43,0:24:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.69,0:24:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,万万没有想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.00,0:24:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,万万没有想到 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable. God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.85,0:24:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真该把这些东西卖了补贴家用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something in here needs to make this family some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.61,0:24:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那就从你开始吧 老家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you old wreck. Judgment Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.83,0:25:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.73,0:25:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,发现闯入者 发现闯入者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder alert! Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.13,0:25:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你个没用的破烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在拨通报警电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am dialing 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 我也算是你的叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tess, I'm basically your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.24,0:25:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家就是我的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Su casa es mi casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.74,0:25:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而咱们家就要保不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're going to lose the casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.74,0:25:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在测试激光吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you working with lasers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是的话我就不进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If so, I'm not coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没见过这种卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys have never seen a truck like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快进来 把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in here. Lock that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.89,0:25:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这破门哪有锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't have a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.06,0:25:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它的散热器上的洞 瞧这个尺寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the hole in the radiator. Look at the size of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西能把它打个洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something blew a hole in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这车身不是一般的钢铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not normal steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎里的弹片 把线路都切断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shrapnel in the engine, it ripped all the connections apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.93,0:25:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了 我的天才马上就用上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And watch. And this took some Cade genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.91,0:25:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定会喜欢这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.52,0:25:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,当我重新接上蓄电池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I hook this back to a working battery...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.82,0:25:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫所有的汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all Autobots.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:25:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 他根本就不是卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. I don't think it's a truck at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.73,0:26:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了变形金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we just found a Transformer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,变形 呃 快撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tran... Ugh! Evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.75,0:26:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.40,0:26:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 我说你是不是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须把那东西弄走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get that thing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.90,0:26:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.60,0:26:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我整晩都在里面工作 沒问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been in there working all night. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.21,0:26:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么没问题 那不是卡车好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? That's not a truck, okay? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那是外星杀人机器 我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an alien killing machine. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.19,0:26:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 他早死了 早就坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude. It's DOA. It's been recalled, totaled, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.29,0:26:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 我知道个热线电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, listen, there's a number that you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.87,0:26:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该拨打这个号码告诉美国政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to call the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.30,0:26:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是作为美国公民应该做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the American thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你还来劲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该马上就打 如果真是外星人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to call, and if it ends up being alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.53,0:26:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以赢得两万五千美元的奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you win $25,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.18,0:26:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是赢钱的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't win money.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.38,0:26:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有要是能活捉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you can capture it live...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并贴上野生动物的标签\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like tag it like a wild wildebeest,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能赢得十万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you get $100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.07,0:26:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 快打电话 - 我听说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad, we're making the call. - I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.22,0:26:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我看过那个广告 他们没有说有奖金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen the commercial. They don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.77,0:26:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在就打电话 - 你是说他们在骗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not a guarantee. - You think Greg would lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.17,0:26:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他真的是芝加哥的変形金刚的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if that's a Transformer there from the Battle of Chicago,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.53,0:26:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道他的来由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.03,0:26:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个发明家 搞不好就会一夜成名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an inventor. This could be a game changer for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它的技术能用在我的发明上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can apply that technology to my inventions,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就再也不用为钱发愁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd never have to worry about money again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.33,0:26:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这种话我可听腻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.79,0:26:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,两万五付大学学费和房贷全都够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-five grand! It pays for my college. It pays for the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.24,0:26:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再说了 这卡车是花我的钱买来的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you used my money to buy the truck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.74,0:26:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以准确的说 这卡车是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So technically, that's my truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:26:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.98,0:27:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是签过有关研究室知识产权的合约的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You also signed a contract regarding all research lab I.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么研究室 这不是个库仓吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Research lab? It's a barn, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你签过合约 现在又来反对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You signed it and now you're competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你的所有点子都属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea of yours is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.18,0:27:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的想法也属于我 你的人都属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any thought you have, I own it, so basically, I own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.03,0:27:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么不觉得你可以拥有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you can own someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是很久以前的事了 都是老黄历了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was, like, a while ago, even in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.51,0:27:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 把焊枪拿过来帮我弄一下吊臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Bring the torch over and help me with the pulley arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.79,0:27:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,弹片摧毁了它的电力核心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the shrapnel took out its power core.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 泰莎 你看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and, Tessa, you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.80,0:27:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.37,0:27:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,外星杀人机器会允许我这么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would an alien killing machine let me do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.63,0:27:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我会报告政府会拿到钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll make the call. We'll get the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但先让我研究一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just first let me see if I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想躲在家里就回去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to hide in the house? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.03,0:27:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.69,0:27:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Pulley arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.04,0:27:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.35,0:27:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来来像导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.60,0:27:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.31,0:28:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有颗导弹 就在客厅里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a missile in the family room!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.72,0:28:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.77,0:28:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 有颗导弹在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, there's a missile in...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.49,0:28:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你们 给我退后 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.05,0:28:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别开火 别开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Don't shoot. Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快 打 911\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call 911! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卢卡斯 - 别跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lucas! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.20,0:28:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你别乱动 冷静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas? Don't move, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.03,0:28:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给我悠着点 人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.31,0:28:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你别动 他不会伤害我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there. He's not going to hurt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.01,0:28:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的武器系统损坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons systems damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.06,0:29:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗导弹击中了你的引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A missile hit your engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.18,0:29:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把他拿了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we took it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你伤的相当重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurt really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.77,0:29:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我家 我是工程师 我叫凯德·伊格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in my home now. I'm an engineer. My name is Cade Yeager.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.48,0:29:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 我欠你一个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, I am in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.83,0:29:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.73,0:29:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Autobots.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.93,0:29:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.79,0:29:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在就得走 得离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to go. I need to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.85,0:29:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样怎么能走远呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far you think you're gonna get?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.05,0:29:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎过来 他需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa, come here. He needs our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.65,0:29:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,人类设计了一个陷阱 突袭了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ambush. A trap. Set by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我逃走 并化身成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I escaped and took this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.42,0:29:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可你是我们的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.47,0:29:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人为什么要伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would humans hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.22,0:29:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们背后另有势力指使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:30:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的汽车人伙伴 能够把我修好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Autobots can repair me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.17,0:30:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但是得先找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. If you can reach 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要不 我来修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.91,0:30:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告你地球人 艾汀杰先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warn you, Mr. Attinger of Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.68,0:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,同盟是一种契约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alliance is a contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.11,0:30:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而契约和人类如出一辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And contracts, like humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.02,0:30:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,都会到期失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expire.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.78,0:30:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们地球上有句谚语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this planet, we have a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.75,0:30:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人的敌人就是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The enemy of my enemy is my friend."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.08,0:30:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有句口头禅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also have a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.29,0:30:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,关我屁事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I don't care."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.02,0:30:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在墨西哥城发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened in Mexico City?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.03,0:31:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我击中他三次 有一处是致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three direct hits. A mortal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.74,0:31:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你的人让他逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your men allowed him to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.49,0:31:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过要提供他的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised me human intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.09,0:31:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你们根本弄不到情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is there such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.33,0:31:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you've still never told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.08,0:31:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么抓他 你到底听谁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you want him? Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.08,0:31:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不管在哪个星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every galaxy I've traveled,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.47,0:31:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这个物种都是一个德行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you species are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都觉得你们自己是宇宙的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all think you're the center of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.90,0:31:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太无知了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.37,0:31:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你去趟五金店 把单子上的东西买齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the hardware store and you get the list. The whole list.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.87,0:31:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想把他修好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you're going to try and fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.42,0:31:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他又不是玩具火车好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a model train set, Cade.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对 所以他才重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's right. He's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.12,0:31:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你在乎 可别人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but important to who?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.12,0:31:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能老把外星人藏在谷仓里呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't keep an alien locked up in your barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.33,0:31:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么着 把他当玩具呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do, play with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.78,0:31:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.58,0:31:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静个屁 是我被十英尺长的炮打中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to, but I just got hit in the head with a ten-foot cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.54,0:31:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿他吃了你 那辆老爷车就归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he eats you, I get the GTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.29,0:31:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,消息绝对不能走漏听见没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a word to anybody. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一个字都别提 跟谁都别说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a single word. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.24,0:31:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们锁定了一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we have a lock on a high-value target.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,特战小组已经做好了准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Operations group is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.00,0:32:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 特战小组接到来自德州的通报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Special Ops just got a call from Paris, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.14,0:32:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这和离开墨西哥城的卡车是同一辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard match on the truck seen leaving Mexico City.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.14,0:32:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个狗娘养的 拿下它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch. Let's go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.21,0:32:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你遭到了重击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took a hell of a hit, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹和你的电源擦肩而过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The missile just missed your power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫火种源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call it a Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.94,0:32:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他包含我们的生命力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It contains our life force,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.12,0:32:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,同时也有我们的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.02,0:32:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,相当于人的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we call it a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,墓风小队出动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scramble Cemetery Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.67,0:32:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,女生们先生们 都辛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your efforts, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.59,0:32:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,走的时候把灯关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This room is going dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.62,0:32:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,出口在你们左手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The exit is on your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我接管这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.85,0:32:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.90,0:32:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,墓风小组在移动中 重复 在移动中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with Cemetery Wind. We're on the move. Repeat, on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.83,0:33:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.46,0:33:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么愿意帮助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you willing to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.91,0:33:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你也愿意信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess maybe because you trust me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.47,0:33:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么去了这么久啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.01,0:33:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我半路上去看了趟医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head hurts. I had to go to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.88,0:33:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我脑袋肿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a welt on my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.96,0:33:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,肿得就像星际迷航里那个反一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes me look like a fricking Star Trek character.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.49,0:33:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,随你怎么讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.60,0:33:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们进入目标区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on property.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.67,0:34:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,蝰蛇-15正在飞越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viper 15 overhead. Angels 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.73,0:34:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.66,0:35:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格先生 我是詹姆斯·萨沃 联邦探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Yeager, my name's James Savoy. I'm a federal agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.36,0:35:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在找一辆废弃的卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men and I are trying to track down an abandoned truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.89,0:35:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你这片地真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nice spread you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.74,0:35:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,卖掉的话很可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad she's for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 但我不卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks. She's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.70,0:35:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找那辆车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That the truck you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.25,0:35:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.72,0:35:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有人打电活报告说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Mr. Yeager, we received a call from someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.12,0:35:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这俩卡车令他忧虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concerned about this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.20,0:35:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.66,0:35:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的忧虑是你们未经允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only thing I'm concerned about is you being on my property,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.36,0:35:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就闯入我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.05,0:35:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们德州人做对是沒有好下场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we got a rule about people messing with people from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.31,0:35:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道你说的什么卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't know what truck you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.12,0:35:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他会夺走美国人的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kind that cost American lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.45,0:35:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,进屋给我搜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the property!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们凭什么搜 你们有搜查令吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "Search the property"? You don't have a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.57,0:35:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我这张脸 就是搜查令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My face is my warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.63,0:35:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们找到卡车了会给我们奖金是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. But if you guys do find a truck, we get a reward, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.83,0:35:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,蝰蛇-15盯住A据点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viper 15 holding, point alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,C组 预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie team, hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.24,0:36:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.84,0:36:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,打开打开快 到左边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open, open, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫 呼叫 没有异状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Short wall. Short wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.74,0:36:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,五号进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five in. Five in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.84,0:36:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,发现闯入者 严禁擅自闯入私宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder alert! Back away from the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.45,0:36:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.50,0:36:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是个愚蠢的小发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just some dumb inventor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.15,0:36:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题 没有异常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear. Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear right. Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.72,0:36:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,注意了 全方位搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}360. 720. Heads on a swivel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.92,0:36:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧 这里什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.63,0:36:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有任何迹象和收获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no signs. We got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 垃圾桶里发现未引爆弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we have a live armed missile in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.03,0:36:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,未引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.18,0:36:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我放进去的你告诉我那是哑弹 凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I carried that to the trash! You told me that was a dud, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.78,0:36:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,差点被炸死 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be dead. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.19,0:36:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 我是找到一辆卡车来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. Okay, yes, I found a truck, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.44,0:36:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想拆了卖了 昨晚还在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I towed it back for the parts. I left it here last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.49,0:36:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可今天早晨他就不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This morning, it's gone. When? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.44,0:36:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道他去哪儿了 我就知道这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I swear to God. That's as much as I know about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.99,0:37:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"他"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Him."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.15,0:37:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了"他" 他知道他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "Him." He knows who the son of a bitch is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Yeager.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.90,0:37:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.61,0:37:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.31,0:37:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说了"他"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just said, "Him."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.51,0:37:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他们拿下 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take them down. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.41,0:37:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.42,0:37:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么都不知道 问我 快放开我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know about the truck! I know! Just let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.82,0:37:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的人宁愿背叛亲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of a man betrays his flesh-and-blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.87,0:37:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也要保护外星人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brethren for alien metal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.12,0:37:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把这家伙给我带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this guy out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.47,0:37:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,抓她 我女儿不知道卡车的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go! They don't know about the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.38,0:37:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 上车 搜索整个区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right! Load up! Search the perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.88,0:37:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯 告密的电话是你打的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas, you called, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.88,0:37:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我 我怎么会认识这些可怕的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I don't know any of these scary guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.18,0:37:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能对女人动粗 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! You're manhandling a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.68,0:37:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我饶不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.04,0:37:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.31,0:37:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.27,0:37:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们不能把我带走 我是美国公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You're not taking me anywhere! I'm an American!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱叫 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.69,0:37:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好 好的 好的 好的 是我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. All right. Okay. All right. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.11,0:37:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,萨沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.05,0:37:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,控制那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.10,0:37:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.99,0:38:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我限你十秒钟说出那辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you got ten seconds. Where's the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.07,0:38:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你们敢对我女儿开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna shoot my little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.27,0:38:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你逼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.02,0:38:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你别开枪 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't shoot me! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.52,0:38:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我该说的都说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know. I told you everything that I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他不见了走了 之前还在 我敢发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone. He left. He was in the barn, I swear to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.97,0:38:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快放开我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.38,0:38:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.58,0:38:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,本来还在的 放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in there! Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.43,0:38:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还剩七秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.48,0:38:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的没骗你 他本来在的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you the truth! He was in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.29,0:38:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.89,0:38:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他 放开我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to get away from my little girl now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.94,0:38:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.09,0:38:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谁敢碰我的女儿我就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You touch her and I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 还剩下两秒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God! - You got two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.75,0:38:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要他说真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.10,0:38:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,毙了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.62,0:39:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 他们打算杀了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade! They're going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.14,0:39:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,向右移动 到那边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push right! Headed to the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车快点 大家快走 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Hurry up! Get in the car! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.17,0:39:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.17,0:39:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫外围 擎天柱要突围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter, Optimus moving your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.99,0:40:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事宝贝 他们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, baby? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要卡车 他们要那辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the truck. They want the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Who are they"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.20,0:40:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你又是谁啊 凭什么叫他宝贝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, and who are you calling "baby"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.90,0:40:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你听见了 回答我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.40,0:40:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是她男朋友 - 他是我男朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm her boyfriend! - He's my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.36,0:40:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你哪来的男朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You're not her boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫肖恩 是个车手 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name's Shane and he drives, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.18,0:40:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是什么车啊 太吓人了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of cars are those? They're so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.32,0:40:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又有一辆追上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another one coming up the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.49,0:40:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,开到玉米地里甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta try to lose them in the cornfield!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.15,0:41:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要追上来了 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming up behind us! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.50,0:41:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蝰蛇-15燃料快用尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viper 15, running on fumes. RTB.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got us cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.02,0:41:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 小心 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, watch out, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.97,0:41:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格先生 我没想在这种情况下跟您见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Yeager, this is not how I wanted us to meet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.23,0:41:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫肖恩 我本来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Shane, and I'm a completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.13,0:41:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就没打算跟你说话 好好开你的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am not talking to you! Drive the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.75,0:41:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.34,0:41:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对他们开枪示警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw 'em some warning shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.80,0:42:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒想到我现在都可以开的这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I don't know how I'm driving this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.68,0:42:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,又上到一个全新的境界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like, today I've gone to a whole other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.38,0:42:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,专心开车 少废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Road, focus! Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.16,0:42:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shane, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.66,0:42:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我承认全都是我错了 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may be primarily my fault, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.77,0:42:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说好会带支票过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said they were gonna bring a check!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.57,0:42:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,结果却是特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know they were gonna send a death squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.43,0:42:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.98,0:42:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当中产生了一位赢家 他就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we got ourselves a winner! Don's got it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.28,0:42:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.19,0:42:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,甩开他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost them!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.64,0:42:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 玉米地里的小帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job, stranger from the cornfields!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那些吓人的车又追过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scary cars are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.52,0:43:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,开到工厂甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose them at the factory, Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.12,0:43:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你很会开车的 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you knew how to drive this thing! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.53,0:43:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那钱拿不到了 别惦记了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we're gonna get that money. Doesn't seem like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.20,0:43:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,引他们上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 'em upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.86,0:43:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,上五楼甩掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're losing them on the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.62,0:44:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,用那招 肖恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do that thing, Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.67,0:44:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 什么 什么招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know it. - What do you mean? What thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.22,0:44:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,反正这招一使出来 相当的刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we're about to do is gonna be kind of scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.82,0:44:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,听看 别让他们跑了 击毙他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take out your guns and shoot them!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.78,0:44:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们开枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 泰莎 做好准备 帮我拉着 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tessa, grab my stick! Grab my stick! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.18,0:44:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她的技术是一流的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got the best hands in the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.83,0:44:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, Tess? Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.24,0:44:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.39,0:44:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不要往上飞啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No f-ing way!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.24,0:44:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.16,0:44:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 看我回去怎么收拾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa, you are so grounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.91,0:44:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了 轮毂裂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! The rim's cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.16,0:44:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是擎天柱 快 快下车 走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus. Come on, move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.82,0:44:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的脚卡住了 等一下 凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My foot's stuck! Wait, Cade!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.32,0:44:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.17,0:44:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.62,0:45:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯 卢卡斯 小心你上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas! Lucas, above you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.98,0:45:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.60,0:45:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 我们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get in, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.07,0:45:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很想看看我的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bet you wish you could see my face right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.61,0:46:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯离开我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas, we just left him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.66,0:46:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.22,0:46:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对于你们失去朋友一事我表示深切的同情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My deepest sympathies for the loss of your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.59,0:46:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在我确定沒人跟来之前 呆在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here till I'm sure we weren't followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.94,0:46:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在全都成了目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all targets now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.03,0:47:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能到处逃窜了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're hiding out now? That's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.80,0:47:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还得听这位卡车师傅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking orders from a truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有什么更好的办法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.51,0:47:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你离他远点 臭小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, move away from her, kid. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.11,0:47:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,手放错地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands off her. All right? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.91,0:47:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你被一个德州的民间发明家弄得灰头土脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your ass kicked by a garage inventor from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.72,0:47:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你的档案记上一笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That goes on your resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.72,0:47:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沒错 你们也都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it goes on all of yours, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.95,0:47:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我想听你在这发牢骚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like I'm in the mood for any of your shit today?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.02,0:47:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿以为我们在追杀霸天虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington thinks we were chasing a Decepticon target,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不先把这一家人拿下来 我们可就露馅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but our story falls apart if we don't find this Yeager family first.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他如果报警或者找联邦调查局呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, what if he goes to the cops or the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.13,0:47:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会转给我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know to hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.03,0:47:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他想重回过去是不可能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His world as he knows it is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.79,0:47:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,往好处想 你们起码认识了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bright side, you guys met.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是哪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he from?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.75,0:47:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 是德州人 开车的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, he's a driver from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.75,0:47:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,德州哪儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.60,0:48:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是德州都柏林市的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where, Dublin, Texas? Shamrock, Texas?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.15,0:48:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他那爱尔兰口音真像个妖精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why does he sound like a leprechaun'?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你在爱尔兰这样说的话 是会挨揍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd get your ass kicked in Ireland for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.56,0:48:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但这里是德州 我的小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're not in Ireland, Lucky Charms. We're in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.76,0:48:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你说他是开车的什么意思 职业司机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so he drives? What do you mean, he drives? Like, for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.01,0:48:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他起码是靠这个吃饭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. At least he makes a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.87,0:48:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.81,0:48:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我是玩赛车的 我是赛车手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I race rally cars. One driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.56,0:48:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再加上个导航员 就是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One navigator. Her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.08,0:48:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 这是我的合法工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, I'm totally legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.98,0:48:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚被红牛车队相中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got picked up by Red Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.68,0:48:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我还要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我口袋里的最后一分钱都砸在那辆车上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my life savings was in that car back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.39,0:48:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩不可能成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.44,0:48:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这必然是能成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it definitely is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.30,0:48:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你多大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.50,0:48:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,二十了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.63,0:48:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她才是个十七岁的女孩啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a 17-year-old girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.90,0:48:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你两条路走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we can work this two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.75,0:48:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要么我把你的脸打开花 然后你报警抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, I punch you right in the mouth and you call the police on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.81,0:48:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 或者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad. - Or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.77,0:48:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我报警抓你 因为你违法了 她是未成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just call the cops on you because this is illegal. She's a minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.36,0:48:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们受《罗密欧与茱丽叶法案》保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're protected by the Romeo and Juliet laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:48:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们交往一阵子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We dated for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.96,0:49:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我高二他高四 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a sophomore, and he was a senior. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.87,0:49:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.02,0:49:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩交往是合法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a preexisting,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.42,0:49:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过是早了一点点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juvenile foundational relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.42,0:49:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,根据2705-3号法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Statute 22.011.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.82,0:49:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.12,0:49:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,德州会有这种法 真有这种法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Texas statute? That a real law?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.68,0:49:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.73,0:49:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,罗密欧与茱丽叶是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romeo and Juliet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.23,0:49:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,知道他们的下场吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how those two ended up?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.48,0:49:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,相爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In love.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,死了 你父母知道这事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead. Do your parents know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.49,0:49:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸同意你找一个十七岁的女孩吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your dad okay with you dating a 17-year-old girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.79,0:49:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我五岁时他就离家出走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took off when I was five,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.24,0:49:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要是碰见他我会问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I ever bump into him, I'll ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.24,0:49:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 泰莎 我本来很相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Tessa, I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.05,0:49:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.35,0:49:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我不贪玩 不闯祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never have fun, take a risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.55,0:49:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,做个像你一样的平凡少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a normal teenager, like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.30,0:49:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你父亲好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your father, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.60,0:49:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是拼了老命在呵护你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have been busting my ass to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.91,0:49:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就把那辆卡车开回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you were doing when you brought home the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.46,0:49:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只要报告政府就没事了 可现在呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you had to do was report it, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.21,0:49:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.89,0:49:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生也完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my life is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.46,0:49:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你啊 你杷我照顾的可真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. You've taken real good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.52,0:50:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你别开枪 求求你 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't shoot me! Please! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.27,0:50:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可真下得去手啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were willing to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.34,0:50:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还是那副德行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.03,0:50:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这幕后一定有人指使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody somewhere gave that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.79,0:50:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找些指纹来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to find some fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.41,0:50:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.60,0:50:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是汽车人 我是汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I'm an Autobot! I'm an Autobot!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.81,0:50:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上所有有用的东西 包括衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab whatever you think we can use for supplies. Clothes, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.36,0:50:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把电脑也带上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take that computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.11,0:50:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.02,0:50:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.52,0:50:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你总能做成点事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you don't suck at everything, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.53,0:50:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.09,0:51:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我说他是个普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me he was no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.59,0:51:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.30,0:51:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个普通人搞定了我们的高科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this "no one" has our tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.38,0:51:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,呼叫全体汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calling all Autobots.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.44,0:51:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 你碰哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.82,0:52:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫帅 什么叫酷 什么叫刺激啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was insane! It was awesome, but it was insane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.33,0:52:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦耶 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah! Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.84,0:52:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他回来了 他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back! He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.94,0:52:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.95,0:53:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,最后 我们终究迎来了希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last. There is hope after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.50,0:53:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,自由星系的领导人回归了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Leader of the Free Galaxy is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.08,0:53:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来 这一点我从不怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you'd make it. I never doubted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.08,0:53:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,收到你的预警 我们一直在等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got your warning. We've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.34,0:53:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 该爆发了 这帮老兄弟重新集结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah. Boom time. We got the gang back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.41,0:53:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,人类要求我们遵守他们的游戏规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans have asked us to play by their rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.01,0:54:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 现在的规则已经改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the rules have just changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.27,0:54:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,人类 只会在背后捅你一刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human beings, bunch of backstabbin' weasels.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.52,0:54:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,探长 你要坚守是非观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hound, find your inner compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.14,0:54:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,忠诚就像一朵脆弱的花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loyalty is but a flower,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.25,0:54:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,处于恐惧和诱惑的暴风中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the winds of fear and temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.51,0:54:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你在胡扯些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.69,0:54:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个俳句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a haiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.79,0:54:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,少废话 否则我把手榴弹丢进你的喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the crap, before I drop a grenade down your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.64,0:54:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你来啊 送死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it, you'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.73,0:54:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好怕呀 快点下手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please pull it. Please do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.44,0:54:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧 还能节省时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, it'll save us so much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.84,0:54:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对于这趟地球之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, raise your hand if you're thoroughly,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.14,0:54:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感到无福消受的人请举手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disenchanted with our little pleasant Earth vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.84,0:54:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这搭顺风车的人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who's the stowaways?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.40,0:54:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛拿抢对着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, whoa, hey, what's with the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.15,0:54:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 探长 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Hound, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.10,0:54:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们冒了生命危险救了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've risked their lives for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.85,0:54:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We owe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.06,0:54:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没有其他同伴的消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, there's been no sign of any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.31,0:54:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 只剩下我们几个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nada. - We are all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.91,0:54:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,人类想把我们一个个干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're picking us off, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.09,0:54:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是可怜的四大金刚 加上你才五个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the pathetic, dirty foursome. And you make five.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.37,0:54:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说我们现在圆满了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's our best-case scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.92,0:54:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,永远得让汽车人罩着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobot witness protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.97,0:55:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我说赛车手 你想走沒人会拦你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Speed Racer, you're welcome to leave anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.48,0:55:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 那我先说清楚 超级奶爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for the record, Superdad,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.53,0:55:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟也不是跟着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not hiding with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.18,0:55:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而是那边那位卡车师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hiding out with that big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 你生死未卜 大黄蜂担任了指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei, with your fate unknown, Bumblebee has held command,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.84,0:55:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这家伙太任性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despite his complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.99,0:55:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,完全沒有一个战士应有的素质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And total lack of anything resembling warrior discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.49,0:55:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.74,0:55:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这孩子正想教训你一下 - 你看你又冲动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This child is about to kick your ass. - He brings us shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.60,0:55:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我决斗 自作聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cage fight. Smartass.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.10,0:55:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.91,0:55:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,难道只有我看出他那双跟小狗一样的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I the lone sage who sees through,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.11,0:55:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是伪装吗 你不称职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This puppy-dog eyes act? It's beneath you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.31,0:55:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 我一直在等他们自相残杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I've been waiting for them all to dispatch each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.26,0:55:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就可以不费劲当上老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I could take charge with no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.52,0:55:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们都听我的指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just me reporting to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.58,0:55:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他们没有你不行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it sure looks like you've been missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.12,0:55:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 禁闭正在追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, Lockdown is hunting us,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.92,0:55:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而人类却在助纣为虐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And humans are helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.43,0:55:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须搞清楚原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.96,0:55:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道原因但我大概知道是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, listen, I don't know why, but I have an idea about who.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.28,0:56:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我扣下航拍机录下了突袭汽车人的画面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This drone I stole recorded footage of an Autobot raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.14,0:56:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,画面断断续续的 但是你们仔细看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in pieces, but watch what happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.30,0:56:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是救护车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's Leadfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.16,0:56:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他被扯成了碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They rip him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.65,0:56:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一群野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.40,0:56:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,卡车上写着KSI建能科技公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And later, this truck comes to haul him off. KSI. Kinetic Solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.00,0:56:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最大的军火空间技术承包商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defense, aerospace, government contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.91,0:56:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们发明了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They designed this drone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.71,0:56:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说政府把你们抓起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So these government guys just hunt you down,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.66,0:56:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再交给KSI\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then pass you off to this KSI?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.16,0:56:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,KSI总部在芝加哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The company is headquartered in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.81,0:56:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人可能都被抓到那儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be where they were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.06,0:56:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,想进去就得大干一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way to get inside without a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.17,0:56:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 如果有人类帮忙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what if you had some human help?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.87,0:56:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在成搭档了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you two partners now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.13,0:56:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 我们也被追浦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetie, we're targets now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.83,0:56:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不查个清楚我们脱不了身的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to know why or we'll never get our lives back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.35,0:56:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我曾发过誓永远不杀人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, I have sworn to never kill humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.86,0:56:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你犯了个大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.21,0:56:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可一旦让我查出谁是幕后元凶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when I find out who's behind this,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.88,0:56:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.98,0:56:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,走你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hooah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.53,0:57:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们已经被通缉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a full-on manhunt out for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.93,0:57:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那就得定好新规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we have some new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.20,0:57:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,带徽章的人都是我们的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone who has got a badge is not our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.54,0:57:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要各个击破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna divide and conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.41,0:57:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个只负责准备食品等必须品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two in charge of stealing food and the essentials. And nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.42,0:57:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,KSI的芝加哥总部就像一个堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chicago KSI headquarters is like a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.22,0:57:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要打入他们绝密的军工部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna find a way into their top-secret military wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.67,0:57:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我得找个把柄要挟这个公司和政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find something to blackmail this company and the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们重回自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna get our freedom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.02,0:57:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 乔伊斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Joyce.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.24,0:57:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.58,0:57:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's "the" sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.78,0:57:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,您要的那个声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要的是无边无际 超凡脱俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I asked for boundless. Transcendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.75,0:58:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要一踏进这个大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you walk through a door in this building,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.18,0:58:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就听起来像是踏入未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should sound like you've stepped into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.08,0:58:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.32,0:58:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.37,0:58:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Future.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.47,0:58:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,过去是历史 现在是过去 而未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The past is history. The present is past. The future is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.88,0:58:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么联络不到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't I get in touch with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.48,0:58:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不了解北扱的发现代表什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you realize what the Arctic find means?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.39,0:58:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我们小时候听到的故事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that story we were all told as children,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.05,0:58:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗巨大的小行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a giant asteroid that struck the Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.35,0:58:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,几百万年前撞击地球导致恐龙灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millions of years ago and wiped out the dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.64,0:58:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大概还记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vaguely.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.89,0:58:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都错了 是这块金属导致恐龙灭绝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were wrong. This metal caused the great extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.30,0:58:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,具体原因还不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How and why, I can't yet say.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.80,0:58:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但同位素检测确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But carbon dating puts,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.05,0:58:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,时间点为公元前六干五百万年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It at 65 million years B.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.60,0:58:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我们挖的这个矿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ore you've got us digging for,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.10,0:58:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比你相像的还要危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is a lot more dangerous than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.46,0:58:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我的人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my people...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.51,0:58:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,达茜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darcy,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.91,0:58:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你这趟在外面跑太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that you've been out in the field for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.61,0:58:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,恐龙的事等晩餐再聊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we discuss dinosaurs over dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.42,0:59:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃肋排吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ribs?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.47,0:59:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.53,0:59:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你想都想不到我们取得了什么进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what's been happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.42,0:59:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这会是一项跨时代的进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to make the quantum leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.43,0:59:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种稀土金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rare-earth metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.03,0:59:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,分子结构非常的不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Molecularly unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.43,0:59:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大规模的产业应用还没开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Industrial uses, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.63,0:59:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,然后外星人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the aliens came.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.44,0:59:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就发现了其中的关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we made the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.49,0:59:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就是这个造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what they're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.84,0:59:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们梦寐以求的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.94,0:59:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们称之为 变形元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Transformium." That's what we're calling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.94,0:59:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这名字不错 通俗 已经注册商标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus-grouped. Catchy. Trademarked.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.55,0:59:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这是继分裂原子以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. This is the greatest advance in modern physics,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.00,0:59:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在现代物理学领域 最为伟大的进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since the splitting of the atom.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.55,0:59:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这种物质是可编程的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's programmable matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.96,0:59:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们排列了它的基因组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, we've mapped its genome.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.26,0:59:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 对 是你排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I. - Now you've mapped its genome.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,而现在我们可以开始来对它进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we can begin to give it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.05,0:59:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,指令的下达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.70,0:59:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是一般的好东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is extremely good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,看仔细了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.08,1:00:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能把它从一种形态变成任何其它的形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can change anything into anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.69,1:00:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就像有感官一样对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensual, almost. Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.34,1:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like music?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.70,1:00:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就让他变成音响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.74,1:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是暴力武器什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps something a little more violent?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.81,1:00:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. You've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.01,1:00:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这可以应用于航天 应用于军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In aerospace, the military...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.02,1:00:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将称霸整个机器人产业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will own the entire robotics industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.32,1:00:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,开拓所有领域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All exploration.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.12,1:00:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,包括在海底 在太空 应有尽有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oceans. Space. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.73,1:00:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,温布利 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wembley. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.93,1:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,广告 这就是你要的那个水母广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jellyfish commercial that you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.38,1:00:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你形容他们像女人一样又诱惑又致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said they were erotic yet deadly, like women.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.58,1:00:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.00,1:01:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.01,1:01:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没 就是没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.56,1:01:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对说过 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I definitely heard you say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.04,1:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时在说你的前女友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause you were talking about your ex-girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.63,1:01:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,说她人很性感 也很贱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was sexy, but a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.17,1:01:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,参观过程中别吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't eat on the tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.64,1:01:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会是她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.35,1:01:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我找了好几箱的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I found a whole bunch of boxes of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.75,1:01:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 你可以穿这些宽松的长裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, sweetie, you can get some long pants, nice, loose-fitting ones,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.60,1:01:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,别穿那些超短裤了好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lose the short shorts, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.26,1:01:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都拿了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you guys get?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.21,1:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋白粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's protein.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.36,1:01:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我说只拿必需品就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I said the essentials, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.36,1:01:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,容易吗我们 差点被抓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't easy. We almost got caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.57,1:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你还偷了漱口水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stole mouthwash?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.27,1:01:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你女儿接吻时要口气清新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to be fresh when I'm making out with your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.48,1:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真逗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.83,1:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这事是不可能的 永远不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's not happening ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.78,1:01:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.11,1:01:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你看看我的杰作 惊破天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our military prototype, Galvatron.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.38,1:01:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真是搞不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.39,1:01:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,已经重置五次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the fifth iteration.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.64,1:01:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么结果还是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he keep turning out like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.92,1:01:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,最终版本只是有些小瑕疵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just some bugs in the final render.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.89,1:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,惊破天 我是照着擎天柱的样子设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I modeled Galvatron after Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.10,1:02:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可为什么他看起来还是像威震天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does he keep looking like Megatron?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.70,1:02:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,生产序列即将完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendering sequence is almost finished. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.80,1:02:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只是简单的代码编写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple coding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.41,1:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么算法呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Algorithms!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.11,1:02:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么数学呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Math!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.51,1:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么没有办法 按照我们的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't we make what we want to make,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.61,1:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,做出我们想要的东西来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way we want to make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.97,1:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.62,1:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这张脸消费者看了会喜欢吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And does that look like a consumer-friendly face to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.06,1:02:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还有胸口那个大洞是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about that big hole in the chest?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.63,1:02:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是觉得很霸气 我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's bad-ass. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.49,1:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.54,1:02:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可我讨厌他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.44,1:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 瞧他来了 这个光头版的科学怪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here he is. That bald-headed Doc Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.54,1:02:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 他们这可是违法的 这是非法实验活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma'am, this is not legal. This is illegal experimentation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.29,1:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,外星人不会对人类做这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aliens would never do this to people!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.45,1:02:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最多也就是把你吃掉 弄死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat you, kill you, maybe, but that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.61,1:02:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不对的 不能把我关在盒子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't right! Nobody puts baby in a box!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.06,1:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.37,1:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这比水刑还要残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is worse than waterboarding!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.03,1:03:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这位迷你先生在帮我们翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This little gentleman has been translating for us,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.84,1:03:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那两颗脑袋里的所有信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the information that comes from these two heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.06,1:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的历史 他们的科学以及一切知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their history, their science, everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.51,1:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那不就是威震天吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Megatron?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.06,1:03:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 他就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.11,1:03:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是怎么弄到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.78,1:03:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是特殊的政府承包项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special government contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.68,1:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们知道变形金刚的所有秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we know everything about Transformers.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.82,1:03:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在可以自主打造变形金刚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now at long last we can build them ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.72,1:03:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而且会更完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we can build them better.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.55,1:03:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 很好 大黄蜂 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's good, Bee. That'll get us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.65,1:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都有好几拨车被运进KSI\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple times a day, these guys are moving in vehicle shipments into KSI,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.04,1:03:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,并作扫描处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For something called canning."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.54,1:03:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而且安保措施滴水不漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major security all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.96,1:03:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们可以拿这个机密研究大楼的入口下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So our best shot at getting in is a back classified research entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.96,1:03:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们早晨开大黄蜂进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna drive in with Bee tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.77,1:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 你们别在我面前亲热好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. There's no smooching in front of me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.37,1:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,您可真是老古板 现在谁还用亲热这个词啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so square. Who even says "smooching"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.43,1:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不受尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, no respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.95,1:04:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候你是一点办法都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just impossible sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.75,1:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 大黄蜂也曾给我这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I went through that with Bumblebee.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.80,1:04:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沉住气 要沉住气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.74,1:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 在这关键时刻应该内心冷酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, at a time like this, the idea is to keep cool,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.25,1:04:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是外表耍酷 所以把眼镜给摘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not look cool, so why don't you lose the glasses?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.05,1:04:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概一个月前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.95,1:04:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我大半夜里听到家里有动静 是不是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}middle of the night, I thought I heard noises in my house. Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.56,1:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 拜托 不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Come on. No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别唬弄我小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lie to me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.61,1:04:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你看那个拿枪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that guy with the gun out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.76,1:04:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这好多人都拿着枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many guys with guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.46,1:04:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,下车告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of the car and tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.39,1:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要闯进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to break in and it's your idea,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.31,1:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不怕 我老了 早就活够本了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I don't care. I'm old, I've already lived long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.77,1:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你说话不挑时候 不分场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a really bad habit of having,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.37,1:04:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个臭毛病真的很不讲究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These conversations at the wrong time, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.67,1:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是你去来文的 还是我去来武的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to come clean or you want me to make a mess?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.72,1:04:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 先生...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, can I talk to you for a second, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.27,1:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他没跟你说话 是跟我 跟我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was me, it was me, it was me, it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.18,1:05:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.60,1:05:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是要扫描的车吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking it in for scanning?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.03,1:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好 可以过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.84,1:05:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我饶不了你 臭小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm literally gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.39,1:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,正在扫描三号库位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning in bay three.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.29,1:05:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们汲取所有外星科技精华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took old, alien technology
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.99,1:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,并在所有方面实现超越\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And made it better in every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.85,1:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,向您介绍"毒刺"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Introducing Stinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.50,1:05:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,KSI "我扪缔造着世界"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KSI. We make the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.96,1:05:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他们的超级机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a bad-ass robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.98,1:05:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,挺像你的 大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He kind of looks like you, Bee.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.54,1:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是组成部件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is the past. And now the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.51,1:05:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们自行打造新版本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're trying to build their own versions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.41,1:05:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,起码他们看起来比这辆酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least they're picking cooler cars than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.92,1:05:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么说话的 - 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You talk to me like that? - Bee, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.82,1:05:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是自作聪明的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see what happens from being a wiseass?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.42,1:05:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.68,1:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"毒刺"灵感来源于大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinger, inspired by Bumblebee,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.58,1:05:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但实现了全线飞跃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But better in every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.58,1:05:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.32,1:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 你冷静点 他受刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! You gotta calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.72,1:06:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's crazy! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.34,1:06:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 大黄蜂 你把动静闹的太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee! Bee, stop going psycho!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.74,1:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以现在我们没有足够的Transformer做生产*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our factory does not have enough transformium for production...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.14,1:06:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 很晩了 是你晩了 是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because you don't keep your promise to supply it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.69,1:06:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲爱的玫瑰花 你一生气我就弄不懂你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My delicate flower, I can't understand you when you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你说什么我一点都听不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I don't really understand you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经没有足够的变形元素用于...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our entire factory is up and running...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.75,1:06:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 稍等一下 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me one second. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.90,1:06:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们俩 手脚够快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you two! Grease monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.31,1:06:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在搞什么名堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on here? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.41,1:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老爷车怎么开这儿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with this vintage crap?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.84,1:06:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不收废旧老爷车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not scanning collector car junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.52,1:06:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你们不了解我们所从事的工作吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think it is that we make here? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.37,1:06:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是在作诗 我们是诗人 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make poetry. We're poets. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.02,1:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我打工 可以犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for me, you get one mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.17,1:06:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是只要一次 不能再这样了 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One. Understood? It won't happen again. - It certainly won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.07,1:06:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让这个可悲的破烂给我消失 还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's get this pathetic thing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.83,1:06:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.58,1:06:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真报歉 非常报歉 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So sorry. So sorry. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看着他 我进去查查 回去告诉其它人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch him. I'm going to see what I can find. Quietly get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.89,1:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了你生气的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear. I swear. I can't bear it when you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.79,1:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我有多纠结吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how it upsets me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.43,1:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 你必须马上冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, you gotta calm down right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.98,1:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm perfectly calm, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.78,1:07:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,随你试深呼吸或者其它什么方法都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta breathe, or just do whatever it is that you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.20,1:07:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我可冷静了 我不会碰它的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calm. I'm calm. I'm not even touching it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.20,1:07:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我基本上没碰它 没挨着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm barely touching it. I'm barely touching it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.21,1:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快点变回车子 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Turn back into a car right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.81,1:07:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别在我眼前晃悠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my face, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.71,1:07:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎我们的设计团队 就从大黄蜂开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our design team, started with the Bumblebee
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.06,1:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个外星机器人的设计即破旧又过时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But really, this alien's design was decrepit and, let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.12,1:07:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,纯属古董\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antique.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.32,1:07:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就是一堆破铜烂铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.72,1:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别冲动 大黄蜂 他们是闹着玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take it personally, Bee.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.57,1:07:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是一个丑字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.12,1:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 见鬼去吧 - 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, hell, no! - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,性能比我还好是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're better than me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.96,1:07:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才踫了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you touch?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.41,1:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,十五分钟以后到我的办公室去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My office in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.88,1:07:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是七号分解室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is dissection room seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.65,1:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,进行惊破天第十二次事后分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galvatron, render postmortem number 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.95,1:07:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,延续第三十二次事件后进行的头部拆解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Continued head disfigurement at event number 32.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.06,1:08:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这买卖怎么样 可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what about the deal? Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.16,1:08:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到种子了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get the Seed?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.01,1:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,会拿到的 抓住擎天柱就有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get it when the bounty hunter gets Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.36,1:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好 不过这事也有复杂性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, there has been a complication.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.87,1:08:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你刚才说什么性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.67,1:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 在KSI我们不用那样的词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. At KSI, we don't use words like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.02,1:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一个窝藏汽车人的平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A civilian harboring the Autobots has,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.82,1:08:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,黑了你的迷你航拍机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hacked into one of your mini-drones.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.83,1:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你的事情 他们应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaning, they may know of your involvement.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.39,1:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真是让人捏一把冷汗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a little bit intense.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.54,1:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要更多的变形元素 我现在就要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need more Transformium, and I need it now,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不然做不出更多原型来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To build more prototypes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.74,1:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,去告诉你的外星赏金猎人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell your alien bounty hunter,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.40,1:08:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我把整个公司整个身家都赌在这个买卖上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I have staked my company on this deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.50,1:08:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,而我赌的是我的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have merely staked my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.45,1:08:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 这事当初是你找我的 记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you came to me on this, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.28,1:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你从中情局退休之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You retire from the CIA,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.75,1:08:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,从我们公司拿到了七位数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get a seven-figure piece of my company,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.01,1:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你我联手改造这个国家的国防事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you and I revolutionize national defense together.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.21,1:09:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 艾汀杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Attinger,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.22,1:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 为了我们两个都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, for both our sakes,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.02,1:09:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要弄到那个种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to deliver the Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.91,1:09:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我进去了 有我摄像头的画面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in. Can you see my camera?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.24,1:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在拆解救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're melting Ratchet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.05,1:09:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们残害了救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They slaughtered Ratchet!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.28,1:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他们撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna tear them apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.90,1:09:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.16,1:09:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得 他们就是一堆金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just metal. That's what I always thought of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.58,1:09:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是 他们像我们一样有生命和灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're not. They're living things, with souls like ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.71,1:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾和其中的一个说过话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once, I spoke to one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.17,1:09:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你研究变形元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're working with Transformium?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.77,1:09:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 是 你说得对 这是我的工作 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah, that's what I do. I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.51,1:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我负责挖掘它 但已经沒有什么好挖的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out there digging for it. There's just not much left to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.03,1:10:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还真缺原料啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's how badly you boys need more, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,沦落到要把邪恶的霸天虎分解掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reduced to melting evil old Decepticons down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.83,1:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他是汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's an Autobot there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.98,1:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,曾是为人类奋战的一方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones who fought for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.92,1:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这件事我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got this taken care of from here. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.49,1:10:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,两个安检门扫到了同样的身份条形码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same badge code scanned at two separate gates.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.14,1:10:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要封锁机密区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having the classified area locked down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.05,1:10:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,盘查那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.25,1:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.01,1:10:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,给我站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.91,1:10:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 说你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.62,1:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.82,1:10:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,给我趴在墙上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.47,1:10:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 商业间谍可是重罪 伊格先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corporate espionage. That's a very serious crime, Mr. Yeager.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.90,1:11:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我要找律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I want a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.91,1:11:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,找司法部或者是我可以信赖的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Justice Department. Somebody I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.91,1:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要伤害我家人的不是你的公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to protect my family, okay? Not from your company,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.31,1:11:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而是政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the government.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.36,1:11:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,伊格先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Yeager,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.81,1:11:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我替谁工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think I work for?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.19,1:11:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你保护家人的决心让我敬佩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to protect your family, that's admirable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.00,1:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但我要保卫国家不受外星战争侵害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to defend the nation from alien war.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.50,1:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们吃过苦头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had a taste of what that looks like,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.75,1:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再重蹈覆辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we are not gonna tolerate another.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.33,1:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.35,1:11:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今天的谈话会有两种结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a version of this conversation,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.34,1:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一是你回到你的谷仓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you get to go back to your barn,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.23,1:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿光荣毕业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your daughter gets to graduate with honors,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.81,1:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,接着过你的正常生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And life as you know it will go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.79,1:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的事情就当什么也没有发生过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what you're involved with here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.04,1:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.54,1:11:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那另一种结局是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the other version of this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.74,1:12:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是你派手下人来谋杀我的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one when you send in the hired help to murder my little girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.32,1:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还是像个爷们那样自己动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you gonna man up and do it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.20,1:12:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那你喜欢哪一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your preference?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.98,1:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我只问你一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to ask you this once.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.01,1:12:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Optimus Prime?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.99,1:12:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.10,1:12:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 去地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're moving. Basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.55,1:12:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.56,1:13:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.06,1:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,科学大会结束了 摧毁实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science fair's over, meatbags! Destroy the lab!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.26,1:13:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,闪开 小心 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, Look out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.30,1:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,全都给我毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy it all!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.09,1:13:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,危险 发现安全漏洞 危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger! Security breach! Danger...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.37,1:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们是我啊 快把我从这鬼地方弄出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! It's me! Break me out of this Frankenstein box!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.03,1:13:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.38,1:13:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是公司的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's company property!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.03,1:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可不是你的个人财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not your property!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.89,1:13:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.14,1:13:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还敢啰嗦 探长现在可就在你面前呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you ain't talking so much now! You got Hound in front of you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.45,1:13:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来啊 让我瞧瞧你们有什么本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Show us your true colors, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.25,1:13:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你给我个信号 我就碾碎他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me the word, I'll splatter him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.05,1:13:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请告诉这位杀红眼的仁兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell Itchy Fingers here,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.11,1:13:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是战争的牺牲品 是死掉的金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That this is all the spoils of war. Dead metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.71,1:13:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们用它创新 我们所从事的可是科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innovation. What we do here is science.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.29,1:14:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为即便我们不做 别人也会做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if we don't do it, somebody else will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.62,1:14:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为科技是你无法阻挡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you cannot stop technology!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.27,1:14:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不是你的什么科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not your technology!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.83,1:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我废了这个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me vaporize his ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.99,1:14:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我破解了密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.43,1:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你们的基因组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I own your whole genome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.36,1:14:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界都会知道你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world will know what you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.11,1:14:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界 全世界都会认同我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world? The world will approve.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.96,1:14:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,人类可以造变形金刚 你还不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make you now. Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.10,1:14:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要你们了 再也不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.50,1:14:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现实太骨感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was cruel.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.76,1:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.36,1:14:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,沒我们的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.36,1:14:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就走了 也不给他们点颜色瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done? We're not gonna kick a little bit of ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.91,1:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点忍不住弄死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been itching to kill something lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.62,1:14:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.82,1:14:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要阻止他 你必须阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop him. You have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.72,1:14:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个从没实战检验过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never been tested in the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.17,1:14:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在实验室和军事基地 还没上过大街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Labs, military bases, but not on civilian streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.47,1:14:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,国防部的承包商刚遭到攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down there a Defense Department contract,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.57,1:15:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是恐怖装击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was just attacked in a terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.33,1:15:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在中情局要采取军事行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is now a CIA military op.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.08,1:15:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,沒人追究你 快动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're indemnified. Respond!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.59,1:15:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.60,1:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,芝加哥 KSI 连接距离最近的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KSI Chicago, closest live sat, patch it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.10,1:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无端遭受汽车人的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been an unprovoked Autobot attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.90,1:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在出动惊破天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up Galvatron.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.83,1:15:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,惊破天 开始变形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transforming Galvatron.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,惊破天 正在启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galvatron coming online.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.26,1:15:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,启动"毒刺"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up Stinger.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.51,1:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"毒刺"正在启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinger coming online.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.42,1:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让那些外星恐怖分子见识一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's show these alien terrorists,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.62,1:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们升级技术的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an upgrade looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.37,1:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,惊破天和毒刺正在去拦截目际的途中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galvatron and Stinger are moving to intercept targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.23,1:15:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,报告 五个目标出现 图橡清晰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reapers. Five targets in the open. Good picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.64,1:16:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,两英里 准备拦截\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two miles to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.45,1:16:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还有两百米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}200 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.05,1:16:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.85,1:16:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,变形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transform.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.99,1:16:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.28,1:16:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是我们编程操控的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are programming this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.98,1:16:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 大部分是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Mostly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.03,1:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,系统无法工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Systems seem to have malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.84,1:16:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定那五个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targeting five bogeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.24,1:16:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,做好发射准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engaging rockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.24,1:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,即将发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missiles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.11,1:17:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 大黄蜂 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta haul ass, Bee! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.91,1:17:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,毒刺正在追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stinger is in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.87,1:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走火了 走火了 打错了 打错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Misfire, misfire! Misfire, misfire!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.28,1:17:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,系统出现错误 惊破天擅自发射四枚火箭弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}System failure. Galvatron just fired four rockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.68,1:17:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 他们玩真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.34,1:17:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇 哇 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.04,1:17:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.60,1:18:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.68,1:18:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在需要一个整建制的医疗队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a full medical team now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.53,1:18:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会有平民伤亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possible civilian casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.63,1:18:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆车里座的可是平民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you got a lot of people in the crossfire here. I don't like...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.79,1:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在为国家和世界创造历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making history here. For your country, for the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.42,1:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的自由正芨岌可危\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human freedom is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.29,1:18:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,无辜的人牺牲 那是常有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innocent people die all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.70,1:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快呀 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Optimus!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.55,1:19:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.56,1:19:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,让他反击 不能倒下 使劲打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him fight. Don't let him go down. Make him fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.14,1:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来 快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.75,1:19:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa! Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.05,1:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快到地里去 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa, run to the field!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.76,1:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就没有灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no soul!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.18,1:19:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,正因为如此 我毫无畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I have no fear!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.78,1:19:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You die!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.16,1:20:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快来救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.73,1:20:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.01,1:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my asset.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.01,1:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把惊破天叫回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull Galvatron back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.76,1:20:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.53,1:21:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.34,1:21:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to go get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.67,1:21:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.35,1:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别过去 他会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go out there! He'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.90,1:21:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去救泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needs my help!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.95,1:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经藏好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's hidden!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.28,1:21:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 要挺住要挺住啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus! Optimus, get up, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.28,1:21:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了 快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.71,1:21:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我很为你惋惜 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel sorry for you, Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.27,1:21:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你对人类太忠心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your allegiance to these humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.92,1:21:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,效忠的本质问题就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trouble with loyalty to a cause,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.27,1:21:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那个你效忠的对象注定迟早都会背叛你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the cause will always betray you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.33,1:21:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁派你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.53,1:21:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你真知道你的来历吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you came from?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.88,1:21:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是被生下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you were born?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.81,1:21:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你是被制造出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You were built.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.92,1:21:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你的造物主要召你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your creators want you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.29,1:21:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是各为其主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all work for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.60,1:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.83,1:22:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.00,1:22:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他要抓她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got her!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.51,1:22:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 离开车子 - 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's in the car! - Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.94,1:22:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.02,1:22:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.02,1:22:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 快出来 快出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa, get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.12,1:22:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.88,1:22:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快出来 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.33,1:22:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 救我 - 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad, help me! - Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.70,1:22:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快来救我 爸爸 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, help me! Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.28,1:22:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.28,1:22:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,打碎玻璃 打碎玻璃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tessa! Break the glass! Break the glass to get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.48,1:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我在打呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.34,1:22:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 泰莎 我抓不住了 - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tessa, I can't hold on! - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.15,1:22:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 泰莎 快打碎玻璃 快打碎玻璃 - 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tessa! Just break it! Break the glass! - Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.79,1:22:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,泰...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tess...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.55,1:23:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 向汽车人发出警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, warn the Autobots!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.26,1:23:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,救我 别丢下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, help me! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.61,1:23:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.29,1:23:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个人类扔到垃圾堆去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that human to the trash.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.51,1:23:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,国防部长先生 我的小队出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Secretary. My team is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.31,1:23:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这回是中情局的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a CIA operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.46,1:23:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是我安排好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my asset.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.01,1:24:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们先撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the military to stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.92,1:24:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等 白宫来电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, I have the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.12,1:24:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 探长 你可算接电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent, hello! Oh, my goodness. Boy,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.22,1:24:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,白宫里已经乱成一锅粥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a flurry of excitement over here at the White House.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.06,1:24:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都气急败坏的 都在冲我发火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody is super, super mad. At me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.41,1:24:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我查了上次的会议记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I went over my notes from our last meeting,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.77,1:24:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不记得你提过会出现现在这种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not sure when you said anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.57,1:24:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,巨型外星战舰降落密歇根大街呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a "giant alien warship over Michigan Avenue."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.07,1:24:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉总统 这并不是攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the President this is not an attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.34,1:24:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,记得这艘飞船吗 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember this ship, Prime?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.54,1:24:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了你们这些远征骑士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Built for all you Knights, you great crusaders,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.75,1:24:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,探索宇宙而建造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To explore the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.45,1:24:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我夺取了控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I commandeered it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.00,1:24:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它是我掌控的监狱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my personal prison now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.31,1:25:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.19,1:25:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到骑士的光荣圣殿 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back to the Knights' Temenos, Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.87,1:25:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经让它蒙羞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have disgraced it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.13,1:26:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快和你那帮忘命天涯的小混们汇合吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Join your fellow rebels, fugitive scum.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.03,1:26:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这里专门收藏稀有的品种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for the rarest of specimens. The worst of the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.09,1:26:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都是恶棍中的恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's taken centuries,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.59,1:26:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经收集了所有的骑士 就差你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've collected all the Knights but you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.35,1:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,造物主想把他的棋子清理干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creators want to sweep their chessboard clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.86,1:26:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会被任何人奴役的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm slave to no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.11,1:26:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这些种群相互搅和在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All this species mixing with species.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.27,1:26:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,才会打破宇宙的平衙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It upsets the cosmic balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.52,1:26:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,造物主们并不喜欢这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The creators, they don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.97,1:26:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们造你就是让你按他们的意思办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They built you to do what you were told.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.39,1:26:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快 它还没有起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why hasn't it taken off yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.84,1:26:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快 大黄蜂 他们在下降 我们上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bee, it's descending. You got to get on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.53,1:26:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,任务已经完成 擎天柱在禁闭手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savoy, mission accomplished. Lockdown has Prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.54,1:26:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在办正事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal's going down now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.39,1:26:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去接头地点把种子拿回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picking up the Seed at the recon point.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.35,1:27:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,已经看见降落区了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nest, Talon. L.Z. appears clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.34,1:27:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我很享受这次猎杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much as I've enjoyed the hunt,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.97,1:27:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不喜欢这破败的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't miss your wretched planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.75,1:27:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么成交吧 以擎天柱换种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our deal is done. One Prime for one Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.79,1:27:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可要小心保护它呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handle it with care.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.19,1:27:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们人类已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust your species is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.95,1:27:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们人类不用你担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about our species.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.36,1:27:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再会啦 地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell, Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.77,1:28:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑啊 快跑啊 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.48,1:28:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.43,1:28:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这个主意太糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.68,1:28:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我就是喜欢这个糟糕的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm all about bad ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.28,1:28:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抄家伙 走你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.08,1:28:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.06,1:28:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这下玩大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.11,1:28:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想撤你就撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you wanna cut and run, you better do it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.98,1:28:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会放弃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna die trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.70,1:28:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来帮你救女儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm not here to help you get your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.86,1:29:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是要你帮我救女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here to help me get my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.76,1:29:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,准备启动暗物质引擎 开足马力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage dark-matter drives. Full power.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.73,1:29:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在深入敌后了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're behind enemy lines now.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.43,1:29:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,禁闭的船很多陷阱 眼睛睁大点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lockdown's ship has booby traps. Eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.64,1:29:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小心那些碎骨机 大脑麻痹仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beware of his bone grinders, brain blinders,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.14,1:29:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,触感探测仪 染色体修改器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flesh peelers, chromosomal inverters,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.19,1:29:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,精神分裂泥 黑洞陷阱门 当然还有辐射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}catatonic sludge, black hole trapdoors, and, of course, radiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.39,1:29:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,动作必须要快 我们要杀他个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be quick. We have the element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.45,1:29:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,暴力对我们来说是万不得已的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try to use violence as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.12,1:29:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.19,1:29:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kill you! Kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.65,1:29:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌那种东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh. I hate those things.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.76,1:29:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's freaky.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.46,1:29:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经被弄死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not alive anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.61,1:29:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好 看完了 他们不在这 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we looked. They're not here. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.06,1:29:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 找不到泰莎 我是不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'? Hey, I'm not going anywhere without Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.46,1:29:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你告诉我 有我什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm unclear. What's in it for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.47,1:29:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有你什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.07,1:29:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你 别激动 有话好好说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy. Let's use words.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.57,1:29:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,对你的好处 就是我不会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in it for you is I don't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.47,1:30:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得救出老大 还有那个女孩 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting the boss back. And the girl. Copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.88,1:30:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你真有说服力 男子气概堪称典范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay. Very persuasive. Textbook machismo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.93,1:30:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看这点 我不搞点破坏是不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then. We'll need to sabotage something.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.09,1:30:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,最好快点 因为暗物质驱动器就要启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better hurry. Because dark-matter drives are preparing to take off.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.89,1:30:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.39,1:30:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有十分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give us 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.49,1:30:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这不会就是这个引擎运转的声音吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what that sound is? The engines filling up?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.89,1:30:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会说这艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that thing's gonna be...
