Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.80,1:34:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉 我真的真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry! I'm so, so, so sorry!
