Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.31,1:35:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太谢谢你了 - 嗯 是他救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. You saved me. - Oh, yeah, he saved you. Yeah.
