Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.21,1:35:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的投降先生有很多话要聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you and Mr. "I Surrender" have a lot to catch up about, sweetie.
