Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.34,1:36:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是擎天柱 擎天柱你在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive! Optimus, sound off!
