Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.49,1:37:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.03,1:37:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not doing this. I am not doing that.
