Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.90,1:45:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 惊破天 它绝对能够成为一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Galvatron. He was...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.90,1:45:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物 一个四不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fiasco. A farrago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.20,1:45:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一个莫大的耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.99,1:45:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而且它张嘴了 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he spoke. How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.39,1:45:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道一个瑕疵代表什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what a flaw is, Wembley?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.49,1:45:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个瑕疵 本质上就是一个彻底的失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A flaw? A flaw is a total failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.09,1:45:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我都控制不了我的产品原型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not have control over my prototype,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.25,1:45:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想知道 这到底是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want to know why!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.96,1:45:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧告诉大黄蜂好消息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give Bumblebee the good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.26,1:45:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们弄到船了 可以离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a ship now. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.18,1:45:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们人类啊 我们尽力帮助你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You humans. After all we have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.02,1:45:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们居然还要自取灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you've wrought upon yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.72,1:45:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你说什么 什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it now? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.02,1:45:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经超出我的能力范围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm doing stuff out of my league here!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.72,1:46:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都不知道是谁在控制谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't see who's controlling who.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.34,1:46:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我在和那个人造金刚战斗时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within that manmade prototype I fought,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.54,1:46:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我感受到他存在的气场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sensed the presence,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.14,1:46:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是威震天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of Megatron.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.25,1:46:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,发动芝加哥之战的那个霸天虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, the Decepticon that started the Chicago war?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.45,1:46:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你以为KSI是怎么做机器人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think KSI built those bots in the first place, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.70,1:46:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿走了一堆死去的霸天虎的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had a whole mess of dead Decepticon heads,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在下载他们的大脑内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they were downloading their minds!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.56,1:46:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而我是负责尸检工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was in charge of autopsy duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.56,1:46:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没有工会撑腰 没有福利 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No union, no benefits, no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.66,1:46:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我连接到威震天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They hooked me up to Megatron,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.22,1:46:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他的大脑实际上没完全死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that mind wasn't as dead as they thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.58,1:46:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他提供给他们技术和详细指标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fed them the science and specs!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.74,1:46:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能给他再造一个全新的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All so they could build him a brand-new body.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.87,1:46:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后威震天用他那邪恶肮脏的虱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he infected it with his evil,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.77,1:46:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,传播他的染色体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty chromosomes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.07,1:46:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那些红眼珠子的小东西呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had red, beady eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.23,1:46:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它们都寄居到我秀发里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got all in my lovely locks. Oh, I can smell it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.33,1:46:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在还能闻到这个味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total inside custom job!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.78,1:46:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,KSI给它起了个响亮的名字叫做惊破天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}KSI might have named the body the snappy name of Galvatron,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.79,1:46:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但它只不过是威震天的化身而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's just Megatron reincarnated!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.49,1:46:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你既然知道为什么不警告他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew this and you didn't warn them?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.59,1:46:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.49,1:47:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你都想像不到那个死囚牢会有多黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go to a pretty dark place when you on death row.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.68,1:47:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,威震天一直把KSI玩弄于股掌之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been playing KSI all this time,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.38,1:47:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这祥就好操纵他们帮他寻找种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All so that he could manipulate them into going after the Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.31,1:47:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. The Seed?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.51,1:47:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见那些追杀我们的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those nasty soldiers that were chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.21,1:47:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们上船时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw them board the ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.09,1:47:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,带走了叫种子的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they took something that they called the Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.22,1:47:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那大约是六千万年以前的事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Sixty million years ago, give or take an eon...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.33,1:47:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,数千颗行星被种子改造实现"赛博坦"化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands of planets were cyber-formed with Seeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.22,1:47:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,将你们这样的有机生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They turned your organic life,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.12,1:47:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,转为构成我们的基本金属元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into our elemental metals.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.68,1:47:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的造物主摧毁了你们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our creators destroyed your world,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.23,1:47:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,才造就了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.98,1:47:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那惊破天就是想再一次毀灭你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's what Galvatron wants to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.74,1:47:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他想引爆那颗祌子 摧毀一座大都市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to detonate that Seed in the biggest city,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.64,1:47:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,并杀害数百万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And kill millions!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.14,1:47:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他要对世界说 宝贝 我又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna show the world, "Baby, I'm back."
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.85,1:47:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸的冲击波会将整座城市焚毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blast wave will incinerate that city,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.05,1:47:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,融化成金属岩浆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into molten metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.90,1:47:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他会组建一支庞大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll have enough to build a massive army
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.38,1:48:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,并且会彻底灭绝你们人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And annihilate your species forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.06,1:48:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些贪婪的蠹货真是自掘坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dumb, greedy bastards just brought extinction to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.96,1:48:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不管我的事 我最终自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my problem, though. I'm free at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.66,1:48:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说结局是好的 我老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whole thing worked out good for me. I'm walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.06,1:48:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要抢在惊破天之前取得种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get the Seed before Galvatron does.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.78,1:48:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那颗种子将是拯救我们公司的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Seed is going to be the salvation of our company.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.39,1:48:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚就会运送过来 而下一个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take delivery tonight. And next month,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.39,1:48:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在蒙古的沙漠安全引爆它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We detonate safely in the Mongolian desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.74,1:48:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,然后创造出变形元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll create enough Transformium,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.34,1:48:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,够用一百年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.95,1:48:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 我不想再逃跑了 也不想再偷东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I'm tired of running and stealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.20,1:48:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有地方睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a place to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.51,1:48:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 还不用交房租\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Just another break-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.86,1:48:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你这个年纪的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I was your age,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.11,1:49:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候挺野的 喜欢飙车 泡妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liked to get a little wild. I liked cars, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.04,1:49:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后有了泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then there was Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.47,1:49:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她出生的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when she was born,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.53,1:49:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我只求她能够平安健康和开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I ever wanted out of life was for her to be happy and healthy and safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.83,1:49:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直以为自己有能力保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow I thought I'd always be enough to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.48,1:49:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,以后不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.64,1:49:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never be.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.54,1:49:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿有人能做得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So somebody better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.45,1:49:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能跟我们共患难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for being here today, Lucky Charms.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.55,1:49:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也谢谢你没有趁机宰了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks for not shooting me when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.55,1:49:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,以后有的是机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'll have more.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.46,1:49:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.14,1:49:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们栏截到了加密的通讯信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've intercepted the encrypted communications.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.43,1:49:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,约书亚·乔伊斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joshua Joyce,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.43,1:49:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,正前住他位于中国广州的工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is headed to his factory in Guangzhou, China.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.80,1:49:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 大老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, big shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.55,1:49:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的公司看起来麻烦不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your company's in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.50,1:50:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好请个好点的律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better have a damn good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.61,1:50:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 留给你自己吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Well, you better have a great one,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.31,1:50:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你要对毁灭整个城市负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're about to be responsible for the annihilation of a city.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.30,1:50:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.30,1:50:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你的技术被黑了 你的产品原型被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tech has been hacked. Your prototypes are infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.05,1:50:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而惊破天的目的是得到那个种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Galvatron is after that Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.89,1:50:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你还有良心 因为你我都是发明家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. I know you have a conscience because you're an inventor, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别给惊破天任何接近种子的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let Galvatron anywhere near that Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.86,1:50:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我在控制惊破天 它是我创造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I control Galvatron. I created him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.76,1:50:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你心底很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep down, I know you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.33,1:50:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的产品在控制你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your prototype's been controlling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.68,1:50:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,坐这个东西到地球的另一端有多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast can that thing get us halfway around the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.41,1:50:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,非常快 那可是宇宙飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very. It's a spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.35,1:50:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如果要走 就现在走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're traveling, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.98,1:50:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想生活回到从前 该怎么办你来定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is to have our life back. It's your call. Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.29,1:51:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,靠自己还是靠他们更安全呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we safer on our own, or are we safer with them?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.18,1:51:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她能撑起个家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a keeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.65,1:51:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是随她妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must take after her mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.46,1:51:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点我无话可说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't argue with that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.56,1:51:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,出发吧 我们要夺回种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! We're retrieving the Seed,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.16,1:51:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这样守护人类的工作就了结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then we're done defending the humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.77,1:51:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 了结 你说了结什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, done? What do you mean, you're done?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.27,1:51:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,意思就是结束了 再见 再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means "finished," "see ya," "good-bye."
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.80,1:51:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他劫持了我飞船的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hijacked part of my ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.80,1:51:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然让这种事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you let this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.05,1:51:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉暗物质引摯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut down dark-matter drive,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.99,1:52:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,光速倒车返回地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reverse course at light speed, and get us back!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.60,1:52:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,撃天柱夺走了我的战利品展柜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime's taken my trophy case.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.85,1:52:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让他尝尝我的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he will feel my wrath!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.31,1:52:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到中国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to China.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.66,1:52:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,把惊破天隔离好告诉工程师千万别激活他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put Galvatron in containment. Tell the techs do not activate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.86,1:52:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,您尽管放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.96,1:52:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,给我最高戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want security on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.22,1:52:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joyce.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.27,1:52:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我多么迫不及待想把种子带给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot tell you how enthused I am to deliver this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.83,1:52:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你最想要的外星科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top of your alien wish list.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.13,1:52:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,它是你的了 或者说是 我们的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours. Or rather ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.94,1:52:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看我的预付款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will need to see my advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.79,1:52:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我那五百万份公司股权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five million shares of the company.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.54,1:52:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将是人类战争的终结者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we're gonna end human warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.14,1:52:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将构建一个自动化的美军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to build a fully automated U.S. Army.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.65,1:52:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,多少美国人的性命将被挽救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just think of all the American lives we're gonna save.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.40,1:53:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.16,1:53:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这个车子很漂亮吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These cars are KSI's,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.36,1:53:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们KSI最好的跑车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newest civilian prototype robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.56,1:53:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候开始批量生产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how soon until we can start continuous production?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.28,1:53:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要不我们先喘口气 这事呆会再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, why don't we take a beat on this for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.29,1:53:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我这有新数据 是我刚发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some new data that I discovered and...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.20,1:53:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想打退堂鼓吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not backing out on me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.60,1:53:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我不想打退堂鼓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not backing out. I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.20,1:53:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我要种子 我没说我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the Seed. I'm not saying I don't want the Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.70,1:53:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying I don't know if I...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.84,1:53:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是现在就需要 种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I want the Seed right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.14,1:53:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的得力干将 为了种子送了命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good men have died trying to get that thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.49,1:53:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了我们 更是为了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For us. For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.00,1:53:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你为此干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you did to get that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.20,1:53:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一连串令人作呕的非法勾当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of illegal, icky shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.66,1:53:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我都能扳倒你 黑色行动 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can take you down, too, Mr. Black Ops.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.66,1:53:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你休想威胁我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.54,1:53:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻的时候创立了这家公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started this company when I was a boy,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.34,1:53:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的梦想是让世界変得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a dream of making the world a better place.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.16,1:54:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有意思 我也有过同样的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny. I had the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.75,1:54:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不知不觉当中 却挣了几十亿美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere along the way, you made billions of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.62,1:54:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那你说说我的梦缺了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you tell me what's missing from my dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.92,1:54:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻时的梦想到底缺了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell me what's missing from my boyhood dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.58,1:54:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我为我的国家效力了几十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have served my country,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.73,1:54:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为实现无比繁荣竭尽全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For decades of unparalleled prosperity
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.83,1:54:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而你呢 就是我的黄金降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are my golden parachute.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.80,1:54:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是识相的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you are damn well,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.34,1:54:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最好跟我一起从"飞机"上跳下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumping out of the plane with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.60,1:54:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我是惊破天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Galvatron!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.41,1:54:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.36,1:54:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你的惊破天突然间就启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Galvatron has gone active.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.61,1:54:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟还有什么在瞒着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What haven't you been telling me?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.46,1:54:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,叫达茜来 叫一部车到楼下 别闹出动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Darcy, and bring a car around downstairs. Quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.47,1:54:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,厂区有紧急情况 你必须离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a factory emergency. I have to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.07,1:54:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.17,1:54:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.97,1:55:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有约定 你拿到了你想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a deal. You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.98,1:55:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿得到了它想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got what "it" wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.63,1:55:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我要你们获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers, today I grant you your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.33,1:55:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起 你们全部都听命于我 惊破天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And from now on, you are commanded by me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.18,1:55:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.09,1:55:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去找我的种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go find my Seed!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.71,1:55:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到最大的城市里去引爆种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detonate the Seed in the largest city.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.22,1:55:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听着公主 别在跟我抱怨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, princess. I don't wanna hear, "I told you so,"
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.27,1:55:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,情况地区比我想的要危急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is much more dangerous than I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.02,1:55:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.48,1:55:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,惊破天黑进了其它产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galvatron's hacked into the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.18,1:55:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.18,1:55:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约书亚 你必须控制场面 - 开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Joshua. You have to contain this! - Drive, drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.98,1:55:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.94,1:56:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上 快 跟上跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's move, let's move, let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.54,1:56:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在香港除掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to lose them in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.31,1:56:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我那边有些得力的朋友 他们可以帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a military garrison there that will help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.96,1:56:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跟中情局职业杀手叫板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Threatening a professional CIA killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.16,1:56:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那可真不是什么明智的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possibly not my finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.86,1:56:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想收回我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to have that one back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.97,1:56:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,职业杀手 我以为他们是你朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killer? I thought they were your friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.37,1:56:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不是朋友 是生意伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not friends. Business.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.97,1:56:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给了我这颗炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave me this bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.17,1:56:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.32,1:56:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,袋子里面装的是炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a bomb in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.92,1:56:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 袋子里面是炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there's a bomb in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.73,1:56:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.19,1:56:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你不再为人类而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you said you were done fighting for humans,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.09,1:56:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你是开玩笑的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't mean that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.39,1:57:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要牺牲多少同类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more of my kind must be sacrificed
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.10,1:57:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,才能弥补你们的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To atone for your mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.30,1:57:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为人类多伟大 人就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think being human means? That's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.55,1:57:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当然会犯错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.95,1:57:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但有时错误中也会诞生出一些美好的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sometimes out of those mistakes come the most amazing things.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.81,1:57:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我当初修好你 是为了获得奖金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I fixed you, it was for a reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.22,1:57:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,仅此而已 很简单 为了钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was it. That was why. For money.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.98,1:57:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我就犯了一个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was me making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.77,1:57:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但不这样也不会有今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without it, you wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.76,1:57:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你对我们完全绝望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So even if you got no faith in us,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.76,1:57:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,也请你跟我做一样的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking you to do what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.99,1:57:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要在垃圾中发现宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking you to look at all the junk and see the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.27,1:57:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你要有信心 摯天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta have faith, Prime,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.74,1:57:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我们的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In who we can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.40,1:57:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不到钱 真让我不爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm seriously pissed we're not getting paid for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.72,1:58:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我们可以杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least we get to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.99,1:58:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他逃不了 我用卫星追踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not getting away if I still got him on satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.49,1:58:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个天才 还以为能甩掉中情局呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some genius. Thinks he can outrun the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.37,1:58:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 约书亚 - 怎么啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Joshua? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.91,1:58:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这炸弹威力有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How lethal is that bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.07,1:58:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我查查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I don't know. Let me check.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.12,1:58:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢 这太棒了 哦 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this! This is so good. Oh, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.18,1:58:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,老大从香港发来短信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting a text from Il Duce in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.23,1:58:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道种子的爆炸范围有多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Need to know the Seed's estimated blast range."
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.93,1:58:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duh.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.25,1:58:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我来引开他们 把那东西转移到安全地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do the diversion! Get that thing somewhere safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.40,1:58:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手要来了 赶快离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killers are coming! Guys, we gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.40,1:58:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,杀手要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.72,1:58:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你闭嘴 闭嘴 - 好好 你们慢慢谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut up! Shut up! - All right! I'm sorry! All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.16,1:59:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 走了 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good? No, don't go! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.27,1:59:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, he's in.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.03,1:59:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要求加薪 你要给我加薪 - 行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need a raise! I want a raise. - All right, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.33,1:59:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都依你 都依你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.76,1:59:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.55,1:59:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.94,1:59:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,死神追上来了 死神追上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is on our tail! Death is on our tail!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.12,1:59:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,全都给我让开 全让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way, all of you! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.75,1:59:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.40,1:59:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,包围他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Box them in.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.39,2:00:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, hurry! Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.69,2:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, yes. I'll follow you anywhere. You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.16,2:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把你送到楼顶上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to get you to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.46,2:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你去哪我去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.42,2:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.87,2:00:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,和战术核弹一样 还大笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}LOL. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.03,2:00:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这事竟然成真的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't... This is really happening.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.01,2:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一个像我这样身价超过两百亿的大老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man, me, who is worth over 20 billion dollars is now
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.11,2:00:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,正在 正在被杀手追杀 还是中情局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being chased by CIA assassins. That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.02,2:00:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我还目睹了机器人造反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the middle of a robot uprising.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.38,2:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我还抱着一颗高级级炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm carrying what is, in essence,
