Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.88,2:00:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而且最棒的就是我几乎用不着倒时差了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the great thing is I... I'm barely feeling any jetlag.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.43,2:01:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你适可而止吧 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just stop it! - What?
