Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.99,2:01:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你安排直升机离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you a helicopter extraction.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.24,2:01:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.71,2:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like her.
