Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.23,2:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,过去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check in there!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.06,2:01:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我刚才说的中情局杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the CIA assassins I told you about.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.07,2:01:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.13,2:01:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.33,2:01:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.99,2:01:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 捡起来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pick it up. - All right. I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.30,2:02:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.85,2:02:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦 谢谢你 哇哦 你怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Wow, thank you. Wow! How did you...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.64,2:02:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,警校练的 然后才念得商学院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police training, prior to my MBA.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.90,2:02:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.31,2:02:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快去楼顶吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.32,2:02:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.28,2:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,给我找到种子 它就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find my Seed. It's here!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.38,2:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这些原型都在追那颗炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those prototypes are after that bomb.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.29,2:03:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.20,2:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那上面是什么人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell's aboard that?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.94,2:03:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.00,2:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,弟兄们 是那拨汽车人 把他们击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brothers, it's the Autobots! Shoot them down!
