Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.36,2:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,全都干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.36,2:04:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.60,2:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我上面有十层楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I count ten below!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.28,2:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你说只有一个原型受到感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said you had one prototype get infected.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.39,2:05:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但他又控制了其他五十个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's got operational control of my other 50.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.48,2:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.24,2:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上去 爬上去 包围他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb, climb! Surround them.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.69,2:05:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,灾难或许是我造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have started the apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.10,2:05:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你把家人扯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you brought your family.
