Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.60,2:05:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 那就拜托你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.80,2:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,回答 擎天柱 还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, Autobots, you alive?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.95,2:05:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 接招 小鬼 - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, bitch! - Come on!
