Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.34,2:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,下面还有敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company below!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.47,2:05:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屁股卡住了 大黄蜂 干掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fat ass is stuck! Bee, take the shot!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.05,2:06:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快快 进电梯 进电梯 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Into the elevator! Get in. - Okay. Come on.
