Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.45,2:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the door! Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.61,2:06:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的 门关不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't go! It's not closing!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.21,2:06:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是超重了 你们去找大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too much weight. Get back down to Bumblebee!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.66,2:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.91,2:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.18,2:06:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你找我对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! You want me!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.67,2:06:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,中央电梯 中央电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Center elevator. Center elevator.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.48,2:06:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.40,2:07:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有外星炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien bomb!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.85,2:07:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,外星炸弹过来了 快让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien bomb, coming through! Clear the way! Clear the...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.25,2:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好 小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, kids.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.60,2:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 劳驾 让我过去一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming through, ladies! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.86,2:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 让我过去 让我过去好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, ladies! Excuse me! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.57,2:07:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪 他们怎么这么淡定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you say, "Get the fuck out of the way" in Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.15,2:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,下面还有很长一段距离呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.31,2:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我开玩笑的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.49,2:08:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.98,2:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.89,2:08:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑不了啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.28,2:09:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该藏匿那辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never should have hidden that truck.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.53,2:09:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也不该追杀我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have never came after my family.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.13,2:09:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,算你倒霉 我们都有家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough luck, Yeager. We all have family.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.02,2:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但我要活着见到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but I'm gonna live to see mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.26,2:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要我捉拿的对象究竟在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my escaped bounty?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.01,2:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人都在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots at this location.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.71,2:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱就在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime is close.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.97,2:09:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么尽管去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do whatever you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.52,2:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这正合我的意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.02,2:10:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 达茜 - 约书亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Darcy! - Joshua!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.70,2:10:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有三个人从那边追过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got three more coming in from that way!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.48,2:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, where's Tessa?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.88,2:10:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.83,2:10:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Okay!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.68,2:10:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在进退两难了 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a real dilemma here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.18,2:10:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我辛苦创造的超级机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I created incredible robots.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.19,2:10:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,到头来却跟那个汽车人胖子较起劲来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all designed to kick that fat Transformer's ass.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.69,2:10:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,说句真心话 这种局面谁都不想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, really, this is a no-win situation.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.69,2:10:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,必须了结它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.29,2:10:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴真欠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was mean.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.19,2:10:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我很抱谦 可你得面对冷酷的现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I'm sorry if you can't handle the cold-hearted truth!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.55,2:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱 这些人类我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, what are my orders with these humans?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.20,2:10:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我能先干掉那颗光头吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I squish the bald guy?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.60,2:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正身处危难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.15,2:10:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可这不是我们的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah! This isn't our fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.16,2:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我当落水狗当够了 真够惨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done being an underdog. Underdogs suck!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.26,2:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就让人类自作自受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say they get what they deserve.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.16,2:10:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么想 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the play, Prime?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.46,2:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该壮大我们的队伍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.89,2:10:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,承认我们的新骑士成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize one of your Knights.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.24,2:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,传奇 他的确存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The legend exists.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.25,2:11:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑啊 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.25,2:11:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on! Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.10,2:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快 大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.06,2:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这 快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we got to move! Let's go, move!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.00,2:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,泰莎 来这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Tessa? Tessa, get over here!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.57,2:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.52,2:11:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跟在我后面 我掩护你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay behind me! I'm covering you!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.32,2:11:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是顶不住了 说明我挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I stop covering you, it means I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.82,2:11:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.06,2:11:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.32,2:11:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是威猛的机器人战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a wicked warrior robot!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.24,2:11:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.44,2:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! We gotta move now!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.44,2:11:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.62,2:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,街上的敌人越来越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got hostiles coming down the street!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.90,2:12:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.23,2:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 12点钟方向 火力掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee! Twelve o'clock! Cover fire!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.26,2:12:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.47,2:12:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快快快跑 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hustle, hustle, hustle!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.67,2:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有火箭弹快蹲下 蹲下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.37,2:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 快快 趴下 趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.34,2:12:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方真适合藏身 一个大玻璃箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is the perfect place to hide. A big glass box!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.05,2:12:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你生怕别人不知道我们在哪吗 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody will ever find us here! That's...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.13,2:12:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是在跟我开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:40.24,2:12:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,各位传奇的战士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legendary warriors,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.24,2:12:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,当初缔造我们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The powers that created us,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.34,2:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在却希望我们全部灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now want us all extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.29,2:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须联合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must join forces,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.49,2:12:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们将永世为奴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or else forever be their slaves.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.75,2:12:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你们将与我们并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So today you stand with us...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.35,2:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,否则 你们就站到了我的对立面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you stand against me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.11,2:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让擎天柱自己解决吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll let Prime figure this one out.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.91,2:13:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,完全赞同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very wise.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.11,2:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,打死我也不会跟他们结成同盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no friggin' way I'm staying down here with them.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.87,2:13:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没门 没门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way. No way.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.62,2:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只有团结在一起 我们才能生存下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only together can we survive!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.68,2:13:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我战斗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me lead you!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.49,2:13:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦不 还以为他会变成一辆大车呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. I was expecting a giant car.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.05,2:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.64,2:13:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你们自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're giving you freedom.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.22,2:14:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你要么保护我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You defend my family,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.83,2:14:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要么就去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or die.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.63,2:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 我们要证明我们的实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, we're going to prove who we are,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.04,2:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们颤抖吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why we're here!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.59,2:14:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是甘愿为他去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh, you just want to die for the guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.49,2:14:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是领袖魅力或者说是洗脑之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's leadership. Or brainwashing, or something.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.05,2:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那就是擎天柱的魅力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.91,2:14:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们一起出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, we charge together!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.61,2:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, roll out!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.28,2:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被包围了 哪边都有夹击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting boxed in! We're getting flanked everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.12,2:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快帮我打 全都打下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me out here! Kill anything that moves!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.82,2:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 凯德 开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Cade, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.82,2:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 混蛋们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get some, you little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.73,2:15:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,注意导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.88,2:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然把性命交给你保管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I'm putting my life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.98,2:15:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气 拿着枪 快点 你能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Be my guest. Take the gun. Come on, you can lead.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.84,2:15:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不拿枪 我不拿枪 你拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't want the gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.34,2:15:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就把嘴给闭上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then stay under there and shut up!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.69,2:15:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You're good with the gun. So you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.30,2:15:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的枪和弹药快不够用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running out of guns and ammo.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.55,2:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快来受死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get some!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.51,2:15:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们全都去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.03,2:15:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看你往哪儿跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, baby!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.68,2:16:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打得好 凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good shooting, Cade!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.80,2:16:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就像个跳芭蕾舞的女胖子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like a fat ballerina,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.54,2:16:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,招招都是豁出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who takes scalps and slits throats!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.55,2:16:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大爷我送你最后一程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your fortune cookie!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.07,2:16:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,走你吧 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.96,2:16:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快打开保险 我顶不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull the pin! I'm dying out here!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.31,2:16:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着它 接着 接着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here! Take it. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.96,2:16:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little help! Little help!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.52,2:16:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它要炸了 要炸了 要炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's live! It's live, it's live. Take it!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.12,2:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那你让我怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.82,2:16:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,扔出去呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just throw it!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.82,2:16:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,给我 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give, give, give!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.20,2:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有个坏消息 凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got some bad news, Cade.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.26,2:16:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒弹药了 彻底没辙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out of ammo and out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.93,2:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,加快速度 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.41,2:17:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.45,2:17:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,给我上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.40,2:18:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这不可能 他们这是要毀掉我的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, impossible! They're ruining everything!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.46,2:18:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.93,2:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:13.77,2:18:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,起来啊 探长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Hound!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.77,2:18:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:15.77,2:18:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须继续战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.87,2:18:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我没力气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank's empty, bro.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:19.82,2:18:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,更多敌人扑上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more of 'em coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:21.02,2:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不上我们都会死的 快去呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't get up and fight, we're going to die. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.78,2:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,发动攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.89,2:18:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus is here!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.93,2:18:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂 跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, jump!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.58,2:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我痛恨蹩脚的抄袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate cheap knockoffs.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.46,2:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awesome job!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.74,2:20:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.19,2:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.79,2:20:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给我过来 - 为什么是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step forward. - Wait. Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.24,2:20:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你的科技将要为你们人类的灭绝而负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your science will be responsible for humanity's extinction.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.85,2:20:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I know that,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.10,2:20:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你对生物伦理议题带来的困境很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sensitive to this whole bioethical dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.80,2:20:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,或许只是让你承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe all he wants to hear you say is,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.10,2:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有些东西就不该被发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That some things should never be invented.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.66,2:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.66,2:20:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会带你们出城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll lead you out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.65,2:20:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把种子安全的带到山上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that Seed safely to the hills.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.93,2:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,用这辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use this car.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.32,2:20:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,它差点吃了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He almost ate me!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.62,2:20:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这车还能开 快上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're good!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.23,2:20:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of that seat.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.70,2:20:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在你运气真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're one lucky dad to have me.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.13,2:21:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好小子行啊你 好吧 你来开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Lucky Charms. You got that. You drive. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.00,2:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.90,2:21:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道 反正问题不小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I don't know, but it's an issue.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.65,2:21:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你碰哪儿了 - 它会爆炸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you press a button? - Is it gonna blow up'?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.40,2:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我不知道.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.25,2:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哔哔叫 你肯定是碰到了什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your thing is beeping now, so you must have hit something.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.46,2:21:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它会爆炸吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it gonna blow up? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.16,2:21:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹哔哔叫一定是有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bomb starts beeping, that might signal a problem, you think?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.16,2:21:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说它在有规律的闪着光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying that it's a steady blinking light,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.76,2:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是倒计时 也有可能是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which could be a timer of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.97,2:21:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它在提供位置信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless it's signaling location.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.22,2:21:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,向谁提供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To who?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.33,2:21:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得请求中央政府支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to call the central government for help!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.94,2:21:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.44,2:21:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 来我这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.85,2:22:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,部长 紧急事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defenser Minister... there's a crisis in Hong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.11,2:23:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,中央政府一定会全力支援香港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The central government will protect Hong Kong at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.31,2:23:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗机已经起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have fighter jets on the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.32,2:23:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,桥在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.68,2:23:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 哇 哇 小心 - 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow, Wow, Wow, - My God
Dialogue: 0,2:23:35.19,2:23:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,倒车 倒车 我们要没命了 倒车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back it up! Back it up!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.59,2:23:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡住视线 我看不见了 看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Get out of the way. I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.85,2:23:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 都冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:55.82,2:23:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shane, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.76,2:23:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,开快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.72,2:24:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我来掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get cover!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:01.72,2:24:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,倒车 快倒车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up! Back! Back up!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.02,2:24:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:14.03,2:24:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别挡路 让开 - 都让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, move! Out of my way! - Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.84,2:24:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 撞就撞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hit them! Just hit them!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.90,2:24:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a big magnet!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.90,2:24:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它把金属吸上去又扔下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sucking up metal and dropping it!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.51,2:24:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看着车 看着车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.41,2:24:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肖恩 快点 快点 - 闪开 快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go faster! Go faster! - Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.76,2:24:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它过来了 它越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming! It's coming! It's coming closer!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.77,2:24:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,开快点 肖恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go faster, Shane!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:54.47,2:24:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快让开 别挡道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.47,2:25:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小心...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.38,2:25:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,又绕回我们这边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, now it's circling back towards us!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.95,2:25:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,向右转 向右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard right! Take a hard right!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:10.72,2:25:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 肖恩 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.39,2:25:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.13,2:25:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.33,2:25:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是大磁铁 下车 快下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the magnet. Get out, get out!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.36,2:25:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大磁铁来了 快快快下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come here! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.11,2:25:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不...我被吸上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! No, we're going up.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.69,2:25:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我拿炸弹 快 快拿炸弹呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab the bomb! Help me grab the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.79,2:25:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我解不开安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get the seat belt off!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.61,2:25:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别愣着 帮帮我 帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me down! Catch me!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.92,2:25:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,拿炸弹 我飘上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going up! I'm going up!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.97,2:25:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我 抓住我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me! Grab me!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.12,2:25:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要飘上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me down! Pull me!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.42,2:25:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我解不开安全带 解不开安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get the seat belt off! I can't get the belt off!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.33,2:25:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我卡住了 我卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stuck! I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.53,2:25:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧炸弹 使劲拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the bomb! I can't hold on!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:58.37,2:26:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快拉 - 拉啊 我撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull! - Guys, it's crushing me!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:12.65,2:26:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Car!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.17,2:26:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.35,2:26:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shane!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.96,2:26:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事 我沒事 我沒事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good! I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.67,2:26:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,大黄蜂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.87,2:26:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,走开 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.02,2:26:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他往这边来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.02,2:26:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.38,2:26:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,躲到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go find someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.83,2:26:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.99,2:26:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get cover!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.60,2:27:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:06.40,2:27:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,汽车人 把这个炸弹从那座桥带离这个城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, get this bomb over the bridge and out of the city!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.46,2:27:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.91,2:27:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:10.72,2:28:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给我吧 我把炸弹带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! I'm getting this bomb out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.67,2:28:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.97,2:28:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我俩该做个了断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you and me now!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.91,2:28:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱正在孤军奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Optimus is out there all alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:24.36,2:28:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你帮不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You can't help him.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.86,2:28:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我得帮 他是为我们回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to, Tess. He came back for us.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.46,2:28:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,爸你别走 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, don't leave, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:28.76,2:28:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我会回来的好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'll find you, I'll get there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.27,2:28:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, no, you'll die!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:31.34,2:28:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 宝贝 你跟着肖恩会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta stay with Shane. You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.80,2:28:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应我要爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promise me you're gonna keep her safe,
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.97,2:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呵护她一生一世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest of her life, until the end of time!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.14,2:28:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你快说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.24,2:28:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:39.14,2:28:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是爸爸最心爱的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best thing I ever made, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:40.50,2:28:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在爸爸心中没什么比得了你 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, don't ever forget it, it was always you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:43.40,2:28:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:45.00,2:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车 上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.30,2:28:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.92,2:28:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:25.19,2:29:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:27.39,2:29:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.39,2:29:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:30.75,2:29:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会丢下我爸不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving my dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.21,2:29:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们要守住这条线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're gonna hold the line,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.56,2:29:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,然后封锁这座桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then block the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:16.63,2:30:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,成为一条汉子需要有耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it takes patience to make a man.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:19.18,2:30:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心注视 忠实守护者天下苍生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The patience to watch and wait, to protect all of us, quietly,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.45,2:30:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,效忠上帝和国家 不求功名与认同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God and country, without any recognition at all!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.01,2:30:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.46,2:30:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,外星人无所谓是好的还是坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no good aliens! Or bad aliens, Yeager.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:36.46,2:30:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只不是我们和他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just us and them.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.71,2:30:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而你选择了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you chose them.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.87,2:30:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,随时奉陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.98,2:31:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你宁愿拯救人类也不愿拯救自己是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved the human instead of saving yourself?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:02.89,2:31:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的脸都被你丟尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring shame upon us all.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.15,2:31:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她就沒听过我的话 从来没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never listens. Never.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:25.31,2:31:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,按我的指令行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you an order!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:41.68,2:31:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快点给我离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.43,2:31:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:45.06,2:31:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿说你呢 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:48.83,2:31:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德 快离开这 这是属于我的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade, get out of here! This is my fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.31,2:31:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fight,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.04,2:32:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们只有死路一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.10,2:32:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:11.46,2:32:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.11,2:32:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:19.25,2:32:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,外星人杀手去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Killer robot, my ass!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:39.15,2:32:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:48.09,2:32:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开 你们快走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.60,2:32:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快 泰莎 快 泰莎 加油啊 泰莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Tess. Come on, Tess. Come on, Tess.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.81,2:33:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.30,2:33:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看到我的脸你就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see my face, your life is done!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.90,2:33:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快点快点快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.67,2:33:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:27.58,2:33:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,光荣就在此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honor to the end.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.99,2:33:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不后悔认识我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still happy we met?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.69,2:33:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,永不后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.63,2:33:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.35,2:33:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.45,2:33:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我要给禁闭设置炸弹 抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly! I'm setting off Lockdown's grenade! Hold tight!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.96,2:34:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会再见面的 擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall meet again, Prime,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.87,2:34:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经重生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For I am reborn.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:31.10,2:34:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔做你的英雄也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of nice being your hero for a change.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:34.45,2:34:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都是 永远都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always were. All my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:38.80,2:34:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.81,2:34:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:43.16,2:34:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,回家参加毕业典礼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home to graduation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:34:45.11,2:34:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:47.36,2:34:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 你小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.21,2:34:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真不赖 真不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, you're all right. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.17,2:34:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无家可归了 它被炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a home, Dad. It blew up.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:02.93,2:35:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我能帮上点忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:11.09,2:35:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,勇敢的机器恐龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brave warriors...
Dialogue: 0,2:35:13.59,2:35:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are free!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:16.89,2:35:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有空再去兜风啊 铁渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ride with you anytime, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.56,2:35:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:40.86,2:35:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.62,2:35:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这颗种子属于我们的造物主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Seed belongs to our creators,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.24,2:35:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他们的身份尚未知晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever they are.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:50.07,2:35:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,仍然有人在悬赏我这颗脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There remains a price on my head.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:53.03,2:35:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我若留下来会连累你们大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I endanger you all if I stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:56.73,2:36:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把这颗种子带到没人能找到的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall take it where it can never be found.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:01.98,2:36:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还会再见面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will we ever see you again?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:03.74,2:36:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,凯德·伊格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cade Yeager,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.38,2:36:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.01,2:36:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但当你抬头仰望星辰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whenever you look to the stars,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:11.00,2:36:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,请把其中的一颗星星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think of one of them,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:14.05,2:36:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,想成我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As my soul.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:17.55,2:36:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请守护这一家人 汽车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defend this family, Autobots,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.79,2:36:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就如同他们守护你们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As they have you.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.11,2:36:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,请守护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defend
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.74,2:36:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,守护他们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All they can be.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:37.17,2:36:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙中有许多谜团是我们永远无法解开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are mysteries to the universe we were never meant to solve.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:43.08,2:36:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们的身份以及我们存在的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who we are and why we are here,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.83,2:36:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,并非无法解答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are not among them.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.64,2:36:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这些答案就在我们的躯体之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those answers we carry inside.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:55.35,2:36:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.53,2:37:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要向我的造物主们发出一条信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this message is to my creators:
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.85,2:37:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别找地球麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave planet Earth alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.27,2:37:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm coming,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.60,2:37:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不会放过你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you.
